INSERT INTO `director_message` (`id`, `section_message`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(2, '<p><img src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" data-filename=\"Prof. Dr. Hafiz Shahzad Asif.jpeg\" style=\"width: 472.982px;\"><br></p><p></p><p style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"text-align: start;\">Al-Khwarizmi Institute of Computer Science is a place where research, technology and people come together to address real-world challenges.</span>Over the years, KICS has grown into a leading centre for applied research, innovation, professional development and technology transfer. As part of the University of Engineering and Technology Lahore, the Institute has built a strong reputation for producing practical solutions in areas that matter to industry, society and the wider economy.</p><p style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; text-align: justify;\">\r\nOur work covers a broad range of fields, including artificial intelligence, cybersecurity, software systems, data science, the Internet of Things, embedded technologies, industrial automation, energy optimisation and renewable energy. While academic excellence remains central to our mission, our real strength lies in turning knowledge into useful outcomes, whether through new technologies, skilled professionals, industry partnerships or solutions that contribute to national development.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; text-align: justify;\">\r\nLooking ahead, our focus is clear. We want KICS to become an even stronger bridge between academia, industry, government and the international research community. This means encouraging collaboration, supporting ambitious ideas and creating an environment in which researchers, engineers, students and professionals can work together with confidence and purpose.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; text-align: justify;\">\r\nAs Director, I am committed to promoting a culture of integrity, openness, excellence and shared responsibility. We will continue to invest in our people, strengthen our research capabilities and expand opportunities for training, innovation and meaningful engagement with industry.\r\n</p>', '2026-07-03 01:10:32', '2026-07-23 07:52:44');
