(185, 'Fruitfly Detector', 0, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: windowtext;\">About 60% of Pakistan&rsquo;s export is dependent on agriculture. European Union is a large market of Pakistani fruits. However, Pakistan struggles to meet the EU standards. Numerous imaging techniques have been used to detect and predict bruises/diseases in fruits. Images gathered through these methods are processed through computer vision and machine learning algorithms. iFruitFly Detector project aims to detect fruit fly infestation in mangoes. The present project focuses on feature extraction, anomaly detection and supervised learning to predict bad regions in fruits. Early bruises are detected through infrared imaging before they can appear actually.</span></p>', 'Project-icon.png', 25, 0, 0, NULL, 'Research', 1, NULL, 0),
(186, 'Semantic Engine for Text Management using Ontology and Knowledge Engineering (SETMOKE)', 1, '<p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><strong>Project Description</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">The amount of textual information available is increasing continuously however, </span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">the human capacity to understand and process information is limited. The phenomena of information overload</span>&nbsp;W<span style=\"font-size: medium;\">hen a lot&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">of redundant information is available and it is difficult or impossible for humans to understand and handle it. Tackling the problem of information overload is necessary for utilizing the information in an effective manner. Thus, in the current&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">era, automatic processing of available unstructured textual information is a big challenge. Therefore, the need of </span>set<span style=\"font-size: medium;\"> of generic tools for automated extraction of useful knowledge and its presentation to the user in flexible ways is evident. We propose an open interface Semantic Engine for Text Management using Ontology and Knowledge Engineering (SETMOKE), to deal with this information overload semantically. </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"padding-left: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">The initial objectives of SETMOKE are as follows<span style=\"color: #222222; font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium;\">:</span></span></p>\r\n<ol style=\"padding-left: 30px;\">\r\n<li style=\"padding-left: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Understand the provided textual data semantically</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"padding-left: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Transform the given unstructured textual data into structured data (ontological database)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"padding-left: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Provide a query and inference mechanism to extract knowledge from the stored Ontological Database (ODB)</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"padding-left: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Open interface availability as plug-in for other applications</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<div style=\"color: #222222; font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px; padding-left: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Hence, the output of our proposed research is a semantic engine (SETMOKE) that presents open interfaces (i.e. API) for knowledge generation and extraction system based on ontology engineering. SETMOKE&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">is deemed to provide a foundation for the development of real world semantic applications without involving the application developer into finer details of knowledge management through ontology engineering.</span></div>', 'Project-icon.png', 27, 0, 0, NULL, 'Research', 0, NULL, 0),
(187, 'Table Structure Recognition using Deep Learning', 1, '<p><span style=\"color: #444444; font-family: \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">Tables are an easy way to represent information in the structural form. Table recognition is important for the extraction of such information from document images. Usually, modern OCR systems provide textual information coming from tables without recognizing actual table structure. However, recognition of the physical structure of tables is required to get the logical meanings of the contents. Table structure recognition in heterogeneous documents is challenging due to a variety of table layouts. It becomes even harder where no physical rulings are present in a table. This work proposes a novel learning based methodology for the recognition of table contents in heterogeneous document images. Text parts of the documents are classified as a table or non-table elements using a pre-trained neural network model. The output of the neural network is further enhanced after applying a contextual post processing on each element to correct the classifications errors if any. The system is trained using a subset of UNLV and UW3 document images and showed more than 97% accuracy on a test set in detection of table and non-table elements.</span></p>', 'Project-icon.png', 25, 0, 0, NULL, 'Research', 0, NULL, 0),
(192, 'MARK II (Electromyography wave sensor and robotic claw)', 1, '<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: #444444; font-size: 16px; font-family: \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">In last couple of years several techniques have been designed to fight many deceases involving limbs and muscles. Several kinds of prosthetics have been invented to resolve the problems that amputees are facing but all of these current techniques are either very costly or are not very feasible. Still millions of people are not able to afford these cures or prosthetics. To search one unified solution for cure and prosthetics a group of young electrical engineers step ahead and designed one unified solution for various problems.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: #444444; font-size: 16px; font-family: \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">Electromyography (EMG) signals can be used for clinical/biomedical applications, Evolvable Hardware Chip (EHW) development, and modern human computer interaction. EMG signals acquired from muscles require advanced methods for detection, decomposition, processing, and classification. &nbsp;For the detection of EMG signal, a really precise EMG Sensor is required. Right now there is not even a single industry which manufactures this sensor in Pakistan. All the sensors currently are being imported.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: #444444; font-size: 16px; font-family: \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">Mark II electromyography wave sensor and robotic claw, an effort of more than 1 and half month. More than 2000 lines of code. Analysis of more than 100000 points. Electromyography is a medical technique used to monitor the working of muscles. This technique involves the placement of electrodes on some special places to body depends upon the muscles you are trying to target. Then you to connect those to electrodes to special circuitry and you can monitor muscle activity. With this you can analyze various deceases and Parkinson&rsquo;s is one of them and not only this we can also use Electromyography in prosthetics. Mark II is peak of optimization. It&rsquo;s just one circuit board having couple of integrated amplifiers and few other components and coupled with a very effective microcontroller form Taxes Instruments based on ARM processor architecture and with a dedicated hardware you can use it with a dedicated software to do real-time plotting. With build in data processing tools analysis is no more a problem. Data logging is now integrated and you are not going to miss even a single point because of a transmission rate of 115200 bits/sec. And not just data logging you can even play the recorded data again.</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: #444444; font-size: 16px; font-family: \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><img style=\"box-sizing: border-box; vertical-align: middle;\" src=\"../pro-photos/1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"400\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: #444444; font-size: 16px; font-family: \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">When we talk about the machine learning in it, we recoded thousands of points and analyzed those using a number of analytical techniques. We modified the algorithm for one specific person. And tested again and again. After recursively modifying the raw data it became highly precise for that person.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: #444444; font-size: 16px; font-family: \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">Now let&rsquo;s come to the prosthetic claw. Claw was designed by KICS UET. It has a servo on it which compels it to open and close at the detection of peak. Now that&rsquo;s the point where DSP plays its role in detection of peak and differentiating between an EMG signal and noise. For that purpose we are checking the slope of curve at each point. There is a sharp slope at the point of peak and a smooth slop at normal points. So detecting that point we generated a PWM to drive the motor. All Parts of this project is printed with KICS 3D printing facility.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: #444444; font-size: 16px; font-family: \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">So that&rsquo;s how it works.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: #444444; font-size: 16px; font-family: \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">Now let&rsquo;s come to its uses and future prospects in the field of medical sciences. Studies in the field of signal processing, especially, surface electromyography signals, have been widely used for understanding the dynamic motions by the fact that most human movements happening dynamically. As mentioned earlier this technology is not common in Pakistan. With the advancement of engineering engineers in Pakistan are trying to link biomedical science with engineering. MARK &ndash;II is a step of it. The modules and prosthetics are imported from abroad for treatment purposes which is really expensive. With the introduction of MARK-II we can not only improve this technology in Pakistan but also can make it available for middle class people.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: #444444; font-size: 16px; font-family: \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">When we discuss its prospects worldwide then we can observe that mounting the module and sensor in in gadget is new. Researchers are finding a solution to this problem of one detachable gadget. MARK-II will solve this problem in near future.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: #444444; font-size: 16px; font-family: \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\">In the end what is the purpose of it? As mentioned earlier &ldquo;One Unified Solution to all Muscular Problems&rdquo;. Making this technology available to all. It&rsquo;s just a first step for such a massive goal. It will take time. But it is possible and we can make it happen. Inshallah.</p>', 'Project-icon.png', 26, 0, 0, NULL, 'Research', 0, NULL, 0),
(193, 'Evento', 1, 'Evento', 'Project-icon.png', 15, 0, 0, NULL, 'Startups', 0, NULL, 0),
(194, 'Smart Bike', 2, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Founder Name: </span><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Rehan</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\"><br /></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Domain/Area: </span><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">IOT, Security</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Opportunity</span><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">: A great opportunity for people to protect their bikes from the danger of theft.<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">USP: (Unique selling point) </span><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">First of a kind </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small; line-height: 115%;\">Business Model: Product sale</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Total Partners: </span><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Sole Owner</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Team Members/Employees:</span><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">3</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Potential Customers: </span><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Motor Bikers</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Abstract/ Solution: </span>It a B2C business. A device is attached to the bike. The main focus of the startup was to make a bike more secure, to stop bike thefts. It also keeps track of bike&rsquo;s location.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 'Project-icon.png', 15, 0, 0, NULL, 'Startups', 1, NULL, 0),
(195, 'Easy Mind; Lost and Found', 4, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Founder Name: </span><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Ahsan Idress<span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Domain/Area: </span><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Mobile Application <span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Problem statement</span><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">: People sometimes forget where they put the things after using them. </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small; line-height: 115%;\">USP: (Unique selling point) First of a kind</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small; line-height: 115%;\">Business Model: In App Purchase, Product Sale</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Total Partners: </span><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Sole Owner</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Team Members/Employees:</span><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">3</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Potential Customers: </span><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Mobile Users</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Abstract/ Solution: </span><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">People sometimes forget where they put the things after using them so this application helps them in location the lost items by tagging the item before using. This was a subscription base app. This application provided product by service.</span></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 'Project-icon.png', 15, 0, 0, NULL, 'Startups', 0, NULL, 0),
(196, 'Med chowk', 5, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Founder Name: </span><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Mian Ashar<span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\"><br /></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Domain/Area: </span><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Medicine Mobile Application <span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Opportunity</span><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">: This was shared economy and <span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span>opportunity for people who cannot afford medicines.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">USP: (Unique selling point) </span><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Medicine Collection and Donation Framework in the form of an app</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small; line-height: 115%;\">Business Model: Shared Economy</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Potential Customers: </span><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Mobile Users</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Abstract/ Solution: </span><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">This was a social Entrepreneurial project. Enterprising</span><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\"> students from UCP leveraged the model of Sharing economy to solve the medical problems of people and formed a Medicine Collection and Donation Framework in the form of an app.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: small; line-height: 115%;\">Their innovative idea was appreciated globally and they were selected as top 100 in Startup Istanbul 2016.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">&nbsp;</span></p>', 'Project-icon.png', 15, 0, 0, NULL, 'Startups', 1, NULL, 0),
(197, 'Chaaba', 6, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Founder Name: </span><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Ali Akbar<span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span>Domain/Area: Food industry<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Opportunity</span><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">: People living in hostels really don&rsquo;t enjoy quality foods. So, this was a great opportunity for Chabba to deliver quality foods.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">USP: (Unique selling point) </span><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Best Quality food for</span> <span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">hostelites.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Business Model: </span><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">B2C</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Total Partners: </span><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Sole Owner</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Team Members/Employees:</span><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">2</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Potential Customers: </span><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Hostelites</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Abstract/ Solution: </span>The main focus of this startup was to provide quality food for hostelites at a standard rate. The one thing about this was that this service was provided at people&rsquo;s door step.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 'Project-icon.png', 15, 0, 0, NULL, 'Startups', 0, NULL, 0),
(198, 'V Selfie', 7, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Founder Name: </span><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Syed Arslan<span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Domain/Area: Social Applications</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Problem statement</span><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">: You cannot take selfies with people who are not present with you.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">USP: (Unique selling point) </span><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Taking selfie remotely with the person who is not present with you is fun. The person can be in another (Country, City) etc.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Business Model: </span><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">App Purchases</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Total Partners: </span><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Sole Owner</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Team Members/Employees:</span><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">3</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Potential Customers: </span><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Mobile Users</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Abstract/ Solution: </span><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">This application was introduced when the selfie trend was rising. You cannot take selfies with people who are not present with you. So, this application brings great opportunity for people living in abroad or out of the city to be with their loved ones in their family pictures.</span></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 'Project-icon.png', 15, 0, 0, NULL, 'Startups', 0, NULL, 0),
(199, 'Dev Cafe', 8, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Founder Name: </span><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Ali Mehmood<span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Domain/Area: </span><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Mobile Applications, Websites, Software Development, Coding<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small; line-height: 115%;\">Business Model: B2C, B2B</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Total Partners: </span><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Sole Owner</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Team Members/Employees:</span><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">6</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Potential Customers: </span><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Mobile and Computer Users </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Current Customers:</span><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">18</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Abstract/ Solution: </span>Ali Mehmood was the very enterprising student of CS and has taken the initiative by opening his own software house. Catering international clients from Norway to England.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>', 'Project-icon.png', 15, 0, 0, NULL, 'Startups', 0, NULL, 0),
(200, 'My Glam Folio', 9, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><a name=\"_Hlk535589283\"></a>Founder Name: Haroon Shahid</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Total Team Members: 1</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Domain/Area: Fashion Industry</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Problem Statement: In our society, it&rsquo;s really hard to showcase your talent professionally among fashion industry due to the gap between aspiring models and photographers.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Solution: We wanted to cut the red tape in the casting process while giving better showcasing opportunities to the aspiring models. We are building an Application more like LinkedIn to engage models with photographers and to showcase their talent on social channels. This will help the upcoming new talent to get a chance to publish in the fashion magazines and on similar websites.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">USP: (Unique Selling Point) No Competitors</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Business Model: Subscription Model</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Potential Customers: Fashion Models, Photographers</p>', 'Glam.jpg', 15, 0, 0, NULL, 'Startups', 0, NULL, 0),
(201, 'Pak Economy', 10, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Founder Name: Jaffer</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Total Team Members: 3</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Domain/Area: Economic/Trading</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Problem Statement: There is no single magazine or platform where we can get all the related information about current situation of economy other than news channels.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Solution: Seeking the business background and I explored my interest in Forex Trading, Stock Market, Shares etc. We designed an insightful magazine covering various aspects of economy currently of Pakistan.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">USP: (Unique selling point)</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Business Model: Subscription Revenue Model</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Potential Customers: Individuals, Organizations</p>', 'Jaffer.jpg', 15, 0, 0, NULL, 'Startups', 0, NULL, 0),
(202, 'Brain Controlled Joystick', 11, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Founder Name: Rohaan Javed</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Total Team Members: 1</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Domain/Area: Games Development/IT</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Problem Statement: There are very few people who don&rsquo;t get bored while doing workout otherwise after a specific time <span style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: .15pt; background: white;\">your motivation drops off the face of the earth. The mere thought of having to do&nbsp;<span style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: italic;\">one more workout</span>&nbsp;makes you bored sick. You&rsquo;d rather do&nbsp;<span style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: italic;\">anything</span>&nbsp;than go to the gym. Go to the movie for three hours, fill, clean your vehicle, anything other than the treadmill. To justify your laziness, you start making little excuses for why it&rsquo;s totally okay to skip your workout.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Solution: To make workout interesting, we came up with methodology to design such games that can be played while working out. Brain Controlled Joystick, the game we developed is let you do workout while focusing on game at the same time. This actually don&rsquo;t let you feel bored and make your workout even more productive.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Business Model: In-App Purchases</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Potential Customers: Individuals, GYM&rsquo;s</p>', 'Project-icon.png', 15, 0, 0, NULL, 'Startups', 0, NULL, 0),
(203, 'Sign Language Translation via Image Processing', 12, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Founder Name: M. Ibrahim</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Total Team Members: 4</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Domain/Area: Image Processing/Manufacturing</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Problem Statement: <span style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: .15pt; background: white;\">There are many impaired people in the world. The communication between deaf/dumb and normal person is always challenging task. This creates an extremely little space for them with communication which is essential part of human life. </span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #333333; background: white;\">Various sign language systems have been developed by many makers around the world but they are neither flexible nor cost-effective for the end users.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Solution: Sign Language is the main communication medium of the impaired people. <span style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #111111; background: white;\">The project uses image processing system to identify, especially English alphabetic sign language used by the deaf people to communicate. The basic objective of this project is to develop a computer based intelligent system that will enable dumb people significantly to communicate with all other people using their natural hand gestures. The idea consisted of designing and building up an intelligent system using image processing, machine learning and artificial intelligence concepts to take visual inputs of sign language\'s hand gestures and generate easily recognizable form of outputs.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Potential Customers: Deaf/ Dumb Persons, Social Welfares</p>', 'Project-icon.png', 15, 0, 0, NULL, 'Startups', 0, NULL, 0),
(204, 'Sign Language Translation via a Glove', 13, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Founder Name: Alvina Ahmed</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Total Team Members: 5</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Domain/Area: Bioinformatics/Manufacturing</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Problem Statement: In many ways of communication, gesture is considered to be one of the most natural way in a virtual reality system. <span style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; letter-spacing: .15pt; background: white;\">There are many impaired people in the world and the communication between impaired and normal person is very challenging.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Solution: Considering the above problem, we develop a gesture recognition system. <span style=\"mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #333333; background: white;\">Hand gesture is one of the methods used in sign language for non-verbal communication. It is most commonly used by deaf &amp; dumb people who have hearing or speech problems to communicate among themselves or with normal people. </span>The glove is a normal, cloth driving glove fitted with flex sensors. The sensors output a stream of data that varies with degree of bend made by the fingers. Flex sensors are sensors that change in resistance depending on the amount of bend on the sensor. The proposed system will be able to recognize different hand gestures, and will make deaf-mute person a better quality of life to work in basic situations.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Potential Customers: Impaired Individuals, Deaf/Dumb Person&rsquo;s, Social Welfare Trusts</p>', 'Project-icon.png', 15, 0, 0, NULL, 'Startups', 0, NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO `kic_group_projectlist` (`projectlist_id`, `projectlist_Name`, `projectlist_seqno`, `projectlist_description`, `projectlist_small_picture`, `group_id`, `subgroup_id`, `sub_site_id`, `code`, `project_category`, `is_completed`, `fundedby`, `inactive`) VALUES
