(248, 'Dual Axis Sun Tracking Heliostat', 0, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span class=\"fontstyle01\" style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">The concentrated solar power (CSP) technology harness solar radiation energy, produces electricity by heating up a working fluid to drive an engine or turbine. Because solar radiation flux is too low to heat up a working fluid, heliostat comes in to concentrate solar flux to achieve that high-temperature 560<sup>o</sup>C. </span></span></p>\r\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle01\" style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\"> <span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">There are generally four types of solar concentrators: parabolic trough, parabolic dish, central-receiver, and linear Fresnel. Out of them, the central-receiver system (CRS) is technically the most efficient design, having high potentials of improvement in the future.</span></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span class=\"fontstyle01\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Previous Work:</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span class=\"fontstyle01\" style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Modelling and simulation were carried out on SolidWorks 2018. Analysis of its structural integrity, weight, and wind load resistance was successfully done on Solid WORKS 2018 Simulation software.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span class=\"fontstyle21\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">In </span></span><span class=\"fontstyle21\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi; color: #000066;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Fig. 01</span></span><span class=\"fontstyle21\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">, a detailed scheme for the experimental connection of</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi; color: black;\" lang=\"EN-GB\"> <span class=\"fontstyle21\"><span style=\"mso-ansi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi;\">the Dual Axis slew drive in the tracking system was illustrated. The purpose of the dual-axis slew drive was to enable the mirror to accurately track the sun throughout</span></span> <span class=\"fontstyle21\"><span style=\"mso-ansi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi;\">the day with the aid of a computer-controlled system. MATLAB and SolidWorks software were used to calculate the positions and angle values of the sun</span></span> <span class=\"fontstyle21\"><span style=\"mso-ansi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi;\">at specific times each day. That is why tracking system was capable of moving the array in both east-west and a north-south axis.</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Current Work:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Currently, we are working on the development of the heliostat at KSK campus of UET in energy Park with the capacity of 3 KW</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">.<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Collaborations:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: .75in; mso-add-space: auto; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi;\" lang=\"EN-GB\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></strong><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Centre for Energy Research and Development (CERAD)<strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"></strong></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Team leader:</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Dr. Naseer Ahmed </span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Team members:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Hammad Farooq, Hafiz Muhammad Waqas Badar, Muhammad Rizwan</span></p>\r\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle01\" style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\" lang=\"EN-GB\"><br /></span></span></p>', 'Project-icon.png', 29, 0, 0, NULL, 'Research', 1, NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO `kic_group_projectlist` (`projectlist_id`, `projectlist_Name`, `projectlist_seqno`, `projectlist_description`, `projectlist_small_picture`, `group_id`, `subgroup_id`, `sub_site_id`, `code`, `project_category`, `is_completed`, `fundedby`, `inactive`) VALUES
(249, 'Solar Parabolic Trough', 0, '<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; color: #222222; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">A&nbsp;<strong>parabolic trough</strong>&nbsp;is a type of&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">solar thermal collector<span style=\"color: #222222;\">&nbsp;that is straight in one dimension and curved as a&nbsp;</span>parabola<span style=\"color: #222222;\">&nbsp;in the other two. The upper surface of the parabolic sheet is then lined with a polished metal&nbsp;</span>mirror<span style=\"color: #222222;\">. The&nbsp;</span>sunlight<span style=\"color: #222222;\">&nbsp;which enters the mirror parallel to its plane of symmetry is focused along the&nbsp;</span>focal line<span style=\"color: #222222;\">, where pipe containing fluid with high coefficient of thermal resistivity are positioned that are intended to be heated which leads to produce steam from water by providing the stored heat.</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span class=\"fontstyle01\" style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Previous Work:</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span class=\"fontstyle01\" style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Modelling and simulation were carried out on Solid WORKS 2018. Analysis of its structural integrity, weight and wind load resistance was successfully done on Solid WORKS 2018 Simulation software. </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Current Work:</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Currently, we are working on development of the heliostat at KSK campus of UET in energy Park with the capacity of 3 KW</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">.</span><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Collaborations:</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 1. Centre for Energy Research and Development (CERAD)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Team leader:</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Dr. Naseer Ahmed </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Team members:</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Hammad Farooq, Hafiz Waqas Bader, Muhammad Rizwan</span></p>', 'dasd.png', 29, 0, 0, NULL, 'Research', 0, NULL, 0),
(250, 'Solar Parabolic Dish', 0, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: medium; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">This project is about the design and development of Dual Axis Sun Tracking with Parabolic Dish.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: medium; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">In this green energy project, parabolic dish harness energy from ultimate energy source SUN and concentrate that light on a single Focal point where we can heat up water to create steam and that steam will run steam Turbine to produce electricity to fulfil the local needs.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span class=\"fontstyle01\" style=\"font-size: medium; font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 107%;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Previous Work:</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span class=\"fontstyle01\" style=\"font-size: medium; font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\"><span style=\"line-height: 107%;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Modelling and simulation were carried out on Solid WORKS 2018. Analysis of its structural integrity, weight and wind load resistance was successfully done on Solid WORKS 2018 Simulation software. </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: medium; font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 107%;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Current Work:</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: medium; font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\"><span style=\"line-height: 107%;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Currently, we are working on development of the heliostat at KSK campus of UET in energy Park with the capacity of 3 KW</span><span style=\"line-height: 107%;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">.<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: medium; font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"line-height: 107%;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Collaborations:</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: medium; font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"></strong><span style=\"text-indent: -0.25in;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 1. Centre for Energy Research and Development (CERAD)</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: medium; font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 107%;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Team leader:</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times; font-size: medium;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Dr. Naseer Ahmed </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: medium; font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 107%;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Team members:</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times; font-size: medium;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Hammad Farooq, Hafiz Muhammad Waqas Badar, Muhammad Rizwan</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\" lang=\"EN-GB\"><br /></span></p>', 'fds.png', 29, 0, 0, NULL, 'Research', 0, NULL, 0),
(251, 'Hybrid Electric Vehicle (HEV)', 0, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">Previous Work:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">Prototype of electric tri wheeler has been developed. Analysis of aerodynamics of tri wheeler for propulsion power calculation yield propulsion power of 3KW. For this purpose 3KW BLDC motor is used in electric tri wheeler.<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span>Features of developed electric vehicle are:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\"><img style=\"vertical-align: middle;\" src=\"documents/labs/gallery/table.png\" alt=\"Base Line\" width=\"601\" height=\"278\" /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\"><br /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Current Work:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Currently we are working on indigenizing the BLDC traction motor its complementary four quadrant drive and body design of electric tri wheeler to reduce aerodynamics</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi;\" lang=\"EN-GB\"><br /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi;\" lang=\"EN-GB\"><img style=\"vertical-align: middle;\" src=\"documents/labs/gallery/fs.png\" alt=\"EV Demonstration presented to Vice Chancellor UET, Director KICS and DICE Delegation\" /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Fig.: EV Demonstration presented to Vice Chancellor UET, Director KICS and DICE Delegation</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Future work: </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">Following goals are aimed to address in future </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">&bull;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">Production of EV BLDC motor and drive</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">&bull;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">Body design of electric tri wheeler to reduce the aero dynamics</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">&bull;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">Production of energy efficient electric tri wheeler </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">&bull;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">Electrification of cars and buses </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Collaborations:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\', serif; font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -0.25in;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1. Center for Energy Research and Development (CERAD)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\', serif; font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -0.25in;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;2. Control and Signal Processing Research Group (CASPR)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Team leader:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Dr. Naseer Ahmed </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Team members:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\"> <span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Hammad Farooq, Hafiz Muhammad Waqas Badar and Ahmad Hussain Safder</span></span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 'Project-icon.png', 29, 0, 0, NULL, 'Research', 0, NULL, 0),
(252, 'Solar Fresnel', 0, '<p><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">This technology incorporates flat reflecting long this plates which reflect sunlight to a common focal point of all plates at which an absorber is placed. The thermal fluid present in the absorber gets heated and then is passed through heat exchanger to make steam which runs steam turbine.</span></p>', 'Project-icon.png', 28, 0, 0, NULL, 'Research', 0, NULL, 0),
(253, 'Solar heliostat', 0, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Solar heliostats along with a solar receiver mounted at a tower is installed at CERAD energy Park. Heliostats focus Sunlight on the receiver mounted at the tower. In this CSP project, the temperature at receiver is higher than parabolic trough resulting in lighter thermal efficiency.&nbsp;</span></p>', 'Project-icon.png', 28, 0, 0, NULL, 'Research', 0, NULL, 0),
(254, 'NWN (KICS UET) and Safe City Authority (SCA) Lahore, Mutually Work for City-Wide Audio Surveillance for audio data detection, data profiling, and acoustic evidence collection.', 0, '<p>The Al-Khawarzmi Institute of Computer Science (KICS), UET Lahore signed an agreement in November 2017 with Safe City Authority (SCA) Lahore to provide citywide acoustic surveillance solution. Under this agreement, KICS will deliver audio surveillance equipment enabled with acoustic evidence collection features, at each camera location. Our low powered environment-friendly product is easily integrable with the existing camera network architecture of SCA. The complete solution including both hardware platform as well as server application software will be delivered for 300 camera sites in Lahore. The solution will enable monitoring of acoustic triggered incidents in real time at the SCA command and control center.</p>\r\n<p><img class=\"img-responsive\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\" src=\"http://kics.edu.pk/images/pro_nwl.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></p>\r\n<p>The customized solution uses audio triangulation with the help of acoustic sensor array to identify the exact location of the source audio incident, which is communicated as an event to the command and control center of SCA.</p>\r\n<p>Our solution will add the following features to the existing SCA surveillance system,</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Continuous audio streaming from camera sites</li>\r\n<li>Web-based monitoring and hardware control and configuration</li>\r\n<li>Audio data profiling for real-time event data</li>\r\n<li>Gun-shot detection and source localization</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Project-icon.png', 5, 0, 0, NULL, 'Research', 0, NULL, 0),
(255, 'Integration and Querying of Heterogeneous Omics Semantic Annotations for Biomedical and Biomolecular Knowledge Discovery', 0, '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Exploring various functional aspects of biological cell system has been focused research area from last many decades. Biologists, scientists and researchers are continuously striving for unveiling the mysterious functional aspects of cellular system to improve the health standards of life. For getting such understanding through analyzing omics data requires heterogeneous and geographically dispersed omics data in well integrated and structured manner. Currently, omics data is available in different types and formats through various data access interfaces. Applications which require off-line data (e.g. for knowledge discovery) face lot of data heterogeneity and geographical dispersion related issues. For taking full benefits of current state-of-the-art data analyses techniques, heterogeneous data must be collected, integrated and warehoused in such a loosely coupled way so that each molecular entity can computationally be viewed independently or in association with other entities within or across the various functional aspects of cellular system. In this paper we propose an omics data integration model, which takes heterogeneous molecular sequence omics data and integrates it according to functional aspects of a cellular system. A software system, which shows significance and usefulness of proposed data integration model, is also within the scope of this study.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Reference URLs:</strong></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Graphical Query Interface: <a href=\"http://omicsknowledgebase.uet.edu.pk:9090/GQI/welcome.jsp\" target=\"_blank\">http://omicsknowledgebase.uet.edu.pk:9090/GQI/welcome.jsp</a></li>\r\n<li>Web Service Interface: <a href=\"http://omicsknowledgebase.uet.edu.pk:9090/WSI/OKBWebService?wsdl\" target=\"_blank\">http://omicsknowledgebase.uet.edu.pk:9090/WSI/OKBWebService?wsdl</a></li>\r\n</ol>', 'logo.png', 8, 0, 0, 'OmicsKnowledgeBase', 'Research', 0, NULL, 0),
(256, 'Four Quadrant Drive for BLDC motor for traction purpose', 0, '<p><span style=\"font-size: medium; font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\">Four Quadrants represents the four modes of operation of BLDC motor. First and third quadrant represent the forward and reverse motoring respectively. Whereas fourth and second quadrant represent the forward and reverse braking respectively. Four quadrant drive will make vehicle able to move in forward and reverse direction, it will also provide the function of regenerative braking so that energy can feed back to the energy resource it will increase the efficiency and reliability of vehicle.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><img style=\"vertical-align: middle;\" src=\"documents/labs/gallery/project1.png\" alt=\"Figure 1 Simulation of Four quadrant Drive in Simulink\" width=\"635\" height=\"267\" /></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: medium; font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\"><strong>Collaborations</strong>:</span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: medium; font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\">Center for Energy Research and Development (CERAD)&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: medium; font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\">Control and Signal Processing Research Group (CASPR)</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Team leader:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Dr. Naseer Ahmed </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Team members:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Ahmad Hussain Safder</span></p>', 'Project-icon.png', 29, 0, 0, NULL, 'Research', 0, NULL, 0),
(257, 'Design and Manufacturing of Servo Trainer', 0, '<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times; font-size: large;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 107%;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Purpose:</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: medium; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">The purpose is to design a self-contained bench mounted A.C. servo system to allow students of all academic levels to investigate basic and advanced principles of servo motor control. In particular this trainer will be designed to deal with the control issues relating to position and speed control in servo systems.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times; font-size: medium;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 107%;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Construction and Features:</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: medium; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">The trainer will have bench top design and will comprise of the following components.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Industrial Grade Servo (DORNA AC Servo Motor)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Dorna AC Servo Motor Drive</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Control Circuit Installed</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Protection Circuits installed</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">DC power Supply</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Variable Power Supply</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Connector for PLC interface</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Dynamic Brake</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Control Mode: Position, Velocity &amp; Torque</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times; font-size: medium;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 107%;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Future Works:</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: medium; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Basic Components of the trainer such as Drive and Motor have been procured. The design and simulations will be done of SolidWorks and Control will be done through DORNA Servo Drive Software DORWIN.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times; font-size: medium;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 107%;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Team leader:</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times; font-size: medium;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Dr. Naseer Ahmed</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times; font-size: medium;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 107%;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Team members:</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: medium; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Hafiz Muhammad Waqas Badar, Hammad&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times; font-size: medium;\">Farooq&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times; font-size: medium;\">and Ahmad Hussain Safder</span></p>', 'Project-icon.png', 29, 0, 0, NULL, 'Research', 0, NULL, 0),
(258, 'Design and Development of High-Performance BLDC Motor', 0, '<p><span style=\"font-family: \'times new roman\', times;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Discription:</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">This project is about the design and development of three-phase BLDC motor. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">In traction application, higher torque per volume motors are required and BLDC motor has this advantage of providing higher torque at low weight and volume as compared to inductions motor. That is why it becomes essential to design and analysis BLDC motors for traction applications.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">BLDC motor is motor without brushes, as its name suggested, unlike DC motor. These days BLDC Motor became very famous in automobiles, aerospace and automation application. BLDC motors are preferable due to its linear torque to speed relation and high power to weight ratio with high efficiency. One of the main advantages of BLDC motor over induction motor is that it possess linear torque to speed relation, which helps to reduce its control complexity in a high precision motion control application.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Simulation of the proposed motor is done on ANSYS Maxwell RMxprt software tool. Development of its prototyping is in process.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi;\" lang=\"EN-GB\"><img style=\"vertical-align: middle;\" src=\"documents/labs/gallery/fasa.png\" alt=\"2-D view of 16 pole, 24 slot, and outer rotor BLDC motor\" width=\"324\" height=\"323\" /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Future work: </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">Following goals are aimed to address in future </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\" lang=\"EN-GB\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">Production of BLDC motor drive</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\" lang=\"EN-GB\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">Production of energy efficient BLDC Motor locally </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\" lang=\"EN-GB\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">Electrification of cars and buses</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\" lang=\"EN-GB\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Production of high-efficient BLDC Celling fan locally</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: \'Times New Roman\', serif;\" lang=\"EN-GB\"><img style=\"vertical-align: middle;\" src=\"documents/labs/gallery/hfd.png\" alt=\"Magnetic field overlay\" width=\"453\" height=\"258\" /></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: \'Times New Roman\', serif;\" lang=\"EN-GB\"><br /></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: \'Times New Roman\', serif;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Collaborations:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -0.25in;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: \'Times New Roman\', serif;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">1.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 17.12px; font-family: \'Times New Roman\', serif;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Centre for Energy Research and Development (CERAD)</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Team leader:</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\', serif; font-size: medium;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Dr. Naseer Ahmed </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-bidi; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-bidi;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Team members:</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\', serif; font-size: medium;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">Hammad Farooq, Hafiz Muhammad Waqas Badar, Ahmad Hussain Safder, Muhammad Rizwan</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 'BLDC Motor.png', 29, 0, 0, NULL, 'Research', 0, NULL, 0),
(259, 'Next Generation IoT Firewall', 0, '<p><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">The security of networked IoT devices is quite challenging since the nature of devices is heterogeneous and the multidisciplinary IoT applications has variable contexts and dissimilar service requirements. The Next Generation IoT Firewall project intends to make progress in this new domain of active safety and research, whereby we will develop,refine and employ our novel ML and AI based algorithms to provide context aware security in IoT network. Efforts will be made to develop hybrid approaches for automatic vulnerability discovery in both small and large scale IoT networks with little or no human intervention. A novel IoT firewall solution will be developed in lowest possible cost based on the open source tools that will help in providing the IoT networks and applications full proof security while ensurig its easy adaptability for different IoT system developers, service providers and device vendors.</span></p>', 'Untitled-1.jpg', 16, 0, 0, NULL, 'Research', 0, NULL, 0),
(260, 'Security Audit Tools for IoT', 0, '<p><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">The limitation in the existing security audit tools is the lack of their adaptation for IoT devices.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">IoT devices are&nbsp; more generic than traditional embedded devices. They may have a very small footprint, limited resources, and they can be heterogeneous in nature. Further, the s</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">ecurity can be incorporated in IoT hardware architecture, firmware as well as software. Hardware security is essential for secure key storage, secure multiparty computation and secure access control.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">Firmware security is</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">essential to provide a secure boot up for IoT device and therefore&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">should be audited as boot up operations of IoT device usually contain critical information. Similarly, secure software in IoT device is crucial, particularly the OS security. That is, there should be protected applications, secure file systems, and secure inter-process communication. Further,&nbsp; security functionalities are usually implemented in IoT communication stack that also need to be analyzed. Hence, in&nbsp; this project a</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;novel security auditing architecture is proposed to be designed and implemented to audit the IoT devices and their networks including the security pertaining to the IoT hardware, firmware as well as Software.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 14.6667px;\">State of the art vulnerability detection of IoT hardware as well as firmware will be incorporated in our security auditing mechanisms.</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 14.6667px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>', 'iot sec audit.png', 16, 0, 0, NULL, 'Research', 0, NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO `kic_group_projectlist` (`projectlist_id`, `projectlist_Name`, `projectlist_seqno`, `projectlist_description`, `projectlist_small_picture`, `group_id`, `subgroup_id`, `sub_site_id`, `code`, `project_category`, `is_completed`, `fundedby`, `inactive`) VALUES
(266, 'Energy Audit of 20 Public Sector Institutes in Punjab including Universities, Hospitals, Medical Colleges ', 1, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; tab-stops: 135.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',\'sans-serif\';\">AERIL KICS-UET Lahore has provided consultancy services to PEECA to conduct detailed energy audits of the Punjab origin Public sector institutes. The scope of work included university campuses, medical colleges and hospitals and their associated departments etc. our teams conducted detailed energy audits, load profiles analysis, energy conservation analysis, financial viability analysis based on IRR, payback period, generator fuel savings analysis, and others such as daily, monthly and yearly energy consumption savings, MDI penalty savings and power factor improvement analysis depending on the suggested retrofits in major consumption loads such as lighting, fans, and ACs. Furthermore, water conservation prospects are also evaluated for audited sites to conserve this necessary resource in future. Detailed reports as per Client&rsquo;s requirement have been delivered to PEECA for each individual audited site. </span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">UET, Lahore</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">UET Taxila</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">UET KSK Campus</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">GCU Faisalabad</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">GCT Sahiwal</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Services Hospital Lahore</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Punjab Institute of Cardiology</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Sheikh Zaid Hospital RYK</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Bahauddin Zakariya University Multan</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">SIMS (Services Institute of Medical Sciences)</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Arid Agricultural University</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">General Hospital Lahore</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Government teaching hospital Shahdara</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Lady Willington Hospital Lahore</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Government Nawaz Sharif Hospital</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">University of Agriculture Faisalabad</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Nishtar Hospital</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Allied Hospital Faisalabad</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">DHQ Hospital Faisalabad</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">GangaRam Hospital Lahore</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">We also provided Energy saving validation after retrofitting of conventional load in GCU Lahore under this project.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">ACTIVITIES:</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Energy Audit of 20 sites</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Walk Through and detailed audits</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Data collection and data analysis</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Water conservation potential</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Renewable Energy Assessment</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Energy audit reports</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Retrofit Recommendations</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">Financial and Cost benefits in terms of IRR and Payback period</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 135.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\">&nbsp;</p>', 'Project-icon.png', 11, 0, 0, NULL, 'Research', 1, NULL, 0),
(280, 'Consultancy and Validation Services for Promotion and Vetting of LED Lights Installation as Energy Conservation Approach', 2, '<p><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',\'sans-serif\';\">PEECA required the consultancy services to promote the LED lights as future energy saving retrofit for public and private sector. In this project, about 5MW energy saving potential was intended targeting commercial and industrial sector. The main focus was the lighting sector energy saving which is the major energy consumer in all sectors. AERIL-KICS provided consultancy services in order to mark and validate the energy saving potential in commercial and industrial sector all over Punjab and provided reports of audits to Client PEECA. The awareness seminars on importance of Energy conservation and LED lighting technology were also conducted to spread awareness. Overall 5MW energy saving potential has been identified in various sites.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">ACTIVITIES:</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Energy Audit and Lighting audit of more than 25 sites</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Walk Through and detailed audits</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Data collection and data analysis</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Energy audit reports</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Retrofit Recommendations</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"text-indent: -0.25in; font-size: 10pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Financial and Cost benefits in terms of IRR and Payback period</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">Validation of already retrofitted Sites and vetting of energy saving potential</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 'Project-icon.png', 11, 0, 0, NULL, 'Research', 1, NULL, 0),
(286, 'FATA Grants Pre and Post Visits/ Validation of Drinking Water Supply Schemes, Irrigation Tube Wells and Solarization systems', 3, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 150%; tab-stops: 135.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: \'Arial\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-bidi-font-style: italic;\">Consultancy services are being provided by AERIL-KICS for Solar PV <strong>energy supply </strong>schemes for Offices , Community centers , Hospitals, Schools, drinking water supply schemes through solar PV systems, irrigation water systems etc. Detailed services include energy audit and pre-assessment of pumping, drinking water schemes, offices, dispensaries and farms, load assessment, technical specifications for solar systems, bidding document, evaluation of bids, and post installation testing. Pre and post visits for more than 50 sites in FATA region have been conducted.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA; mso-bidi-font-style: italic;\">Scope includes following: Orakzai, Kurram, North Waziristan</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA; mso-bidi-font-style: italic;\">ACTIVITIES:</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoPlainText\" style=\"margin-left: .25in; line-height: 115%; tab-stops: 135.0pt; layout-grid-mode: char; mso-layout-grid-align: none;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Services provided are listed below:<strong> </strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Pre-feasibility visits for energy audit, load assessment</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">System Designing, specifications and BOQ</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Preparation of Bid documents</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Technical Bid Evaluations</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">System Verifications/Validations for marked sites by Client</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">Post Installation Inspection of sites</span></li>\r\n</ul>', 'Project-icon.png', 11, 0, 0, NULL, 'Research', 0, NULL, 0),
(287, 'Consultancy Services for project “Solarization of Off-Grid and Other Schools in Punjab”', 4, '<p><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Government of Punjab initiated the solar system installation for 4321 remote off-Grid Government schools all over Punjab to improve the electricity provision situations at schools. AERIL-KICS, UET Lahore provided Technical consultancy services to assist DOPP Energy Department.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Scope of work included:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Survey of schools to observe technical and structural data,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Data analysis of schools provided by Schools Education Department,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Technical specifications for system solutions according to the load considerations and designs,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Preparation of Bid Document for Contractor,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Contractor Technical Bid Evaluation,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Prototypes Evaluation,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Assistance in Award of Contract,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Field inspection and reporting during installation by Contractor,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Completion testing and Reporting</span></p>', 'Project-icon.png', 11, 0, 0, NULL, 'Research', 1, NULL, 0),
(288, 'MeStdy', 0, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 4.25pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Founder Name :</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\"> Khalid Bashir</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 9.6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">Domain/Area: EdTech</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: .05pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.7pt; line-height: 116%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 116%; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">Problemstatement:Emergingtechnologies<span style=\"letter-spacing: .1pt;\">have</span>notbeenutilizedtoserveeducationspreadtoits fullest, which in turn reflects the un-satisfactory image of EdTech world in middle-east and other parts of the world. This <span style=\"letter-spacing: -.15pt;\">issue </span>has to be addressed to gain complete potential <span style=\"letter-spacing: -.2pt;\">of </span>education through online (internet/tech)world.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 9.85pt; margin-right: 5.7pt; margin-bottom: .0001pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 116%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 116%; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">Solution: \'Mestdy is an online learning platform where you can build your educational identity and engage with your network, meet other learners around the globe. Access knowledge, insights and opportunities. Join or create virtual classrooms for quality learning experience. Upload educational videos, give reviews and much more.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 9.85pt; margin-right: 5.7pt; margin-bottom: .0001pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 116%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 116%; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-font-width: 95%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span>USP:(Uniquesellingpoint)Mestdystandsouttobefirstuniquelyidentifiedandaffordable solutiontotheedTechworldwithanexcellentengineeringdoneintheinteractionphaseofthe </span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 116%; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">onlineknowledgesharingplatforms.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 10.15pt; margin-right: 5.6pt; margin-bottom: 10.0pt; margin-left: 0in; line-height: 120%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 120%; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">BusinessModel:(diagram)Mestdyreceivesacommission(smallfee)foritsservicessuchas <span style=\"mso-font-width: 95%;\">providingadatabaseandnetworkforlearnersandteachersand<span style=\"letter-spacing: .1pt;\">an</span>excellentinteractionpoint </span>(platform)forlearnersandtutors.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 10.4pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">Potential Customers: Potential customers are:-</span></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"margin-top: 3.95pt; margin-right: 6.15pt; margin-bottom: .0001pt; margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 120%; mso-list: