(297, 'RADA TECHNOLOGIES', 0, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Founder Name:&nbsp; </span></strong><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Abdullah Afzal<strong></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Domain/Area: &nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Automation <strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Problem Statement/Opportunity: </span></strong><span style=\"line-height: 115%; color: #626262; letter-spacing: 0.2pt;\">An intuitive sense of market dynamics and emerging trends has established us as a pioneer, leading the way with the most innovative technology on the market. From custom designed products to large-scale collection production .Our customer&rsquo;s need is our prime focus</span><strong></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Solution/Abstract : </span></strong>RADA Technologies is an automation based company, striving to provide best and easy solution to operate home appliances remotely and automatically based on sensors and feedback from human&nbsp; interaction with devices. We are a group of students from UET, the prestigious engineering We are a group of students from UET, the prestigious engineering institute of engineering we are planning to provide the doorstep and one window solution to all automation projects. Our products will be manufactured in Pakistan and are affordable to the middle class families. Our vision is to make home automation a commodity for every home by 2020, from offices to home, restaurants to robots and all the electrical appliances will work automatically, which include Fans, Lights, Exhausts, Air-Conditioners, Refrigerators and Cameras with Face detection security features.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">USP: (Unique selling point </span></strong><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">:</span> <span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Our primary focus is to provide effective, high quality automation services, utilizing our highly qualified engineering resources.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Current</span></strong></span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><strong><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">&nbsp;Customers:</span></strong><span style=\"line-height: 115%; color: #222222;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"color: #222222; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">1.Polycon industries</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: