me automation a commodity for every home by 2020, from offices to home, restaurants to robots and all the electrical appliances will work automatically, which include Fans, Lights, Exhausts, Air-Conditioners, Refrigerators and Cameras with Face detection security features.<strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">USP: (Unique selling point </span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">:</span> <span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Our primary focus is to provide effective, high quality automation services, utilizing our highly qualified engineering resources.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background: white;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Current Customers:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Helvetica\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #222222;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Helvetica\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #222222;\">Polycon industries</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Helvetica\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #222222;\">Ittefaq Industries</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Helvetica\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #222222;\">Plan 9</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Helvetica\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #222222;\">Virtual Eye</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Helvetica\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #222222;\">Smart Mirro</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Team Members:<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span>5 </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 'Project-icon.png', 15, 0, 0, NULL, 'Startups', 0, NULL, 0),
(298, 'JALBOT JALEBI & DUMPING BOT', 0, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">Founder Name: </span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">Abdullah Afzal<strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">Domain/Area</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">:<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>Food Industry<strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">Problem statement: </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #202020; background: white;\">I conceived this idea sometime in February of 2017, while visiting a friend in Norway,&rdquo; relates Abdullah Afzal, co-founder of RADA Technologies. &ldquo;For the last four decades he has been running a couple of bakeries there with the distinction of being the only exclusive selling brand of Pakistani traditional foods, such as samosas, sweets, jalebis, in Oslo. Like other European countries, labor in Norway is very costly. Jalebi requires a unique skill-set to create and currently he is the only person able to do the job there.&rdquo;</span><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">Solution/ Abstracts</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #202020; background: white;\">The robot chef can prepare up to 40 kilograms of Jalebi per hour in its stainless steel structure. Furthermore, it can be programmed to change the shape of the sweet as per the customer&rsquo;s wishes. Other than Jalebi, Jalbot can create different shapes using other ingredients such as chocolate.</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; color: #202020;\"> <span style=\"background: white;\">Growing food chains always focus on maintaining their product&rsquo;s quality, while JALBOT is the only Jalebi robot chef on the market that follows the international Food Technology Standards. So the bot has received a positive feedback from the global market, as a Norwegian food chain has acquired some of them while a bakery in UK also plans to buy the robot chef for their kitchens</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: 16.5pt; vertical-align: baseline;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Open Sans\'; color: #282828; border: none windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: none windowtext 0in; padding: 0in;\">&ldquo;Our aim is to automate the food industry not only in Pakistan but also in abroad. This machine is expected to take the food processing industry to new heights of automation as this will produce better, faster and affordable food items with premium quality at the same time</span></em><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Open Sans\'; color: #282828; border: none windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: none windowtext 0in; padding: 0in;\">.&rdquo; &ndash; Abdullah Afzal</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; border: none windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: none windowtext 0in; padding: 0in;\">Video Player</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">USP: (Unique selling point) : </span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Open Sans\'; color: #282828; background: white;\">The robot&rsquo;s stainless-steel structure has the maximum production capacity of 40 kilos of jalebi per hour. It can also be programmed to customize the shape of the jalebi as per customer demand</span><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">Potential Customers: Sweet Shops</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">Current Customers: </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">Monthly Sales:<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">Annually Sales: <span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">Team Members:<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span>5 </span></strong></p>', 'Jalbot.png', 15, 0, 0, NULL, 'Startups', 0, NULL, 0),
(299, 'GAME STUDIO', 0, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Founder Name:<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Mamoon Mustafa <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp; </span><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"mso-tab-count: 6;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Domain/Area: <span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>Coding<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Opportunity: </span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; color: #444444;\">What is really encouraging is that a majority of these are the initiatives of young professionals, who have studied from the prestigious universities in the USA etc or have given up their lucrative jobs and have returned, with the sole objective to make a name for Pakistan in the world of mobile game apps.&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt;\">Solution: </span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Trying to introduce a new era of mobile games we are working towards creation of creative and innovative mobile games. The game genres would generally include educational apps and games for kids and challenging strategy games for adults. The idea is to engage the user to spend their time usefully and creatively while challenging their mental acumen.</span><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">USP: (Unique selling point)</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Business Model: (diagram)</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Potential Customers: </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Current Customers:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Monthly Sales</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">:<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>60,000<strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Annually Sales:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Team Members:<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span>8</span></strong></p>', 'Mamoon.png', 15, 0, 0, NULL, 'Startups', 0, NULL, 0);
