e trying to do via nibbleview.com</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">USP: (Unique selling point): <span style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">It has best and easy text based tutorial. The language of tutorials are very easy for even non-English nations also we are working to reduce load time more and more low.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">Business Model: <span style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Currently business model is traditional but in respectable manner- Ad network. No pop adds, No irritating ads. Soon we will also include paid courses, paid books, paid physical seminar/workshop/courses etc.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">Potential Customers: <span style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Our potential customers are widely spread over the global. Any body who want to learn about any technology could be our customer.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">Current Customers: <span style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Current customers are from many countries.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">Monthly Sales: <span style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Not yet as we are in primitive stages.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">Annually Sales: <span style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">We are new to market so currently no.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">Abstract:<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">The more and more graduates of computer science are in market now, universities give only basics about computers. All students have to learn this online. There are many platform but no one is from Pakistan. I want to make it world biggest technology learning platform from Pakistan.</span></p>', 'Tayyab.jpg', 15, 0, 0, NULL, 'Startups', 0, NULL, 0),
