(318, 'Hando.Pk', 0, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Founder Name:</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Ahmad Ali</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 300%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 300%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 300%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 300%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Founder picture:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Product Name:</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Hando.Pk</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 300%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 300%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 300%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 300%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Product Picture:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 300%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\"><br /> <strong>Domain/Area</strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;E-Commerce</span><br /> <strong>Problem statement:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Physical shopping is difficult&nbsp;it needs time.</span><br /> <strong>Solution:&nbsp;</strong></span>Ecommerce customer service (sometimes spelled e-commerce customers service) is a strategy for providing customer service to customers on online stores. When retailers invest in improving their ecommerce customer service, delivered via a call center, live chat, or other channels, they tend to be rewarded with more loyal customers, better conversion rates, and an advantage over their competitors.&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 300%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\"><br /> <strong>USP: (Unique selling point)</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 300%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 300%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Online selling and home delivery.<br /> <strong>Business Model: (diagram)</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 300%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 300%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">B2C<br /> <strong>Potential Customers:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 300%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 300%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">All the homes<br /> <strong>Current Customers:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 300%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 300%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">200+<br /> <strong>Monthly Sales:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 300%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 300%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">70000<br /> <strong>Annually Sales:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 300%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 300%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">840,000<br /> <strong>Abstract:&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 300%;\">Ecommerce customer service (sometimes spelled e-commerce customers service) is a strategy for providing customer service to customers on online stores. When retailers invest in improving their ecommerce customer service, delivered via a call center, live chat, or other channels, they tend to be rewarded with more loyal customers, better conversion rates, and an advantage over their competitors.&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Hando.Pk</span> helps retailers build great relationships with their customers by improving all aspects of the customer experience. <span style=\"font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Hando.Pk </span>offers tools that handle everything from&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.zendesk.com/voice/\"><span style=\"mso-color-alt: windowtext; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;\">phone support</span></a>&nbsp;to&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.zendesk.com/analytics/\"><span style=\"mso-color-alt: windowtext; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;\">analytics</span></a>, social media to&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.zendesk.com/internal-help-desk/\"><span style=\"mso-color-alt: windowtext; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;\">internal operations</span></a>. It&rsquo;s fast and flexible so retailers can easily adapt to the changing landscape of consumer expectations and scale when they grow.<br />&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>', 'Project-icon.png', 15, 0, 0, NULL, 'Startups', 0, NULL, 0),
