.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-font-width: 95%;\">Zero</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: .1pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-font-width: 90%;\">Annually Sales:</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-font-width: 90%; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Zero</span></h1>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">Abstract:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 2.95pt; margin-right: 5.95pt; margin-bottom: .0001pt; margin-left: 5.95pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 120%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">Anarchitectural&amp;constructiondesignservicesasanIdeaofstartupsparkedon15December,2018. <span style=\"mso-font-width: 95%;\">Thisconsultancywillengagedifferentsortofvendorsandexperiencedpersonsfortheprovisionofall theseservicestoprivateanduniversityprojects.TheselectedArchitecturalfirmwillworkwithPartners in buildings and making recommendations based on the conditions, program, schedule andbudget.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-right: 5.85pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 120%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-font-width: 95%;\">BasedontheProgramandsiteevaluation,thearchitecturalfirmwillprepareconceptualdesigns,which willinclude,asaminimum,asiteplan,floorplan,elevations,sectionsandoutlinespecificationsto describethesystemsandmaterialsplannedforthefacilities.AtthesuccessfulconclusionofConceptual Design,meaningthattheprojectgenerallymeetsthepreviouslyapprovedProgramdesigncriteriaandis </span><span style=\"font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">generallythoughttobewithinbudgetandonschedule.</span></p>', 'Project-icon.png', 15, 0, 0, NULL, 'Startups', 0, NULL, 0),
(320, 'University Testing Forum & Blog', 0, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Founder Name:</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Bilal Qamar</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 300%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 300%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 300%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 300%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Founder picture:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Product Name:</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">University Testing Forum &amp; Blog</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 300%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 300%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 300%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 300%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Product Picture:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 300%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\"><br /> <strong>Domain/Area</strong><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Testing and Blog&nbsp;Portal&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong></strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 300%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 300%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Problem statement:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 300%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 300%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Students face a lot of problems regarding academic data and notes etc.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 300%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\"><br /> <strong>Solution:&nbsp;</strong></span>They are providing trial access to their data and providing comprehensive, searchable archive of every page, advertisements, info and University notes regarding their exams, about new admissions and jobs. The issues are reproduced as high-resolution color page images and supported by fully searchable text and data.<br /> <strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 300%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">USP: (Unique selling point)</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 300%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 300%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Relevant notes and data online. <br /> <strong>Business Model: (diagram)</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 300%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 300%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">B2C<br /> <strong>Potential Customers:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 300%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 300%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">University Students<br /> <strong>Current Customers:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 300%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 300%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">500+<br /> <strong>Abstract:&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 300%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 9.0pt; line-height: 300%; mso-bidi-font-family: Consolas; color: #222222; background: white;\">This is where the internet steps in, a realm of&nbsp;student resources&nbsp;with bountiful information about anything, where you can learn the things (or that you weren&rsquo;t interested in learning at the time), such as how to budget your money, how to arrange an overdraft with your bank, and how to iron your clothes without leaving an iron-shaped pattern. In short, all the student resources you could ever possibly need are available online.</span> They are providing trial access to their data and providing comprehensive, searchable archive of every page, advertisements, info and University notes regarding their exams, about new admissions and jobs. The issues are reproduced as high-resolution color page images and supported by fully searchable text and data.<br style=\"mso-special-character: line-break;\" /> <!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br style=\"mso-special-character: line-break;\" /> <!--[endif]--><strong></strong></p>', 'Project-icon.png', 15, 0, 0, NULL, 'Startups', 0, NULL, 0),
(321, ' Cyber Brain', 0, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Founder Name:</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Hafiz Bilal</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 300%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 300%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 300%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 300%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Founder picture:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Product Name: </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Cambria\',serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Cyber Brain</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 300%;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 300%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Product Picture:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 300%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\"><br /> <strong>Domain/Area</strong>:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 300%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 300%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Cyber&nbsp;Learning</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 300%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\"><br /> <strong>Problem statement</strong>:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 300%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 300%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;Lack of Professional skill-based learning for youngers.<strong> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 300%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\"><br /> <strong>Solution:&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 300%;\">Providing training from 3-10 years students.<span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 300%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\"><br /> <strong>USP: (Unique selling point)</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 300%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 300%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Only Institute providing cyber Training to younger </span>from 3-10 years students.<span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 300%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\"><br /> <strong>Business Model: B2C</strong><br /> <strong>Potential Customers: </strong></span>3-10 years students<strong></strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 300%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\"><br /> <strong>Abstract:&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">The course is aimed at anyone who wants to create websites on their own, and possibly work as a freelancer or employee in the field of web design and development. We cover everything, so even if you\'ve never seen HTML code in your life, you\'ll be able to quickly jump in.</span><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">The one and only IT mentor of the Pakistan who provided his services as a mentor to the students to earn 6 world records.<br /> <!--[if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br /> <!--[endif]--></span></p>', 'Project-icon.png', 15, 0, 0, NULL, 'Startups', 0, NULL, 0),
