ers: </strong>Students, office,</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"> teenagers, University students etc.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 300%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\"><br /> <strong>Current Customers: </strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 300%;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 300%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">150 Daily</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 300%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\"><br /> <strong>Monthly Sales:</strong><br /> <strong>Annually Sales:</strong><br /> <strong>Abstract:&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">PirchPyali </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">will focus its marketing activities on reaching the University students and faculty, people working in offices located close to the tea bar and on sophisticated teenagers.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">PirchPyali</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"> consumption is universal across different income categories, education Institutes, University campus and access to the targeted customer audience.</span></p>', 'Project-icon.png', 15, 0, 0, NULL, 'Startups', 0, NULL, 0),
