i-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top: 0in; margin-right: 0in; margin-bottom: .0001pt; margin-left: .5in; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: .5in;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Cambria; mso-fareast-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Cambria; mso-bidi-theme-font: major-latin;\"><span>&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Domestic Tourists</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri;\">Monthly Sales:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri;\">On Average Our Monthly Sales are approximately around 0.83 Million</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: 0in; line-height: 12.25pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri;\">Annually Sales:&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri;\">Our Annual Sales are approximately around 10 Million</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri;\">Abstract:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 23.0pt; line-height: 97%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri;\">&ldquo;To become Pakistan&rsquo;s first Tourism Company providing quality, creative, cultural enriching, socially responsible and secure services to our customers&rdquo;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: 11.0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 110%;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri;\">We aim to begin and nurture a healthy and reliable environment, in which our employees fairly repaid and are encouraged to respect the tourist and the quality of the service we intend to provide. In addition, follow-up will be indenture so to ensure customer satisfaction and make any upgrading as recommended by the customers in future. We seek fair and responsible profit, enough to keep the company financially healthy throughout, and to fairly deal employees for the effort and work.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: \'Cambria\',serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-latin;\">APNA TRIP&rsquo; offers a unique consultative approach, warm personalized service and above all, the execution of creative ideas that reveal each destination&rsquo;s authentic character. Whether it be a Historical city tour for a day, or be it a cultural retreat, a leisure escape or a Hilly getaway for the weekend, or trip to the Northern Areas for a week or a mountaineering expedition for a month, Apna trip is the easiest way for people to experience true beauty of Pakistan.</span></p>', 'Arshad.jpg', 15, 0, 0, NULL, 'Startups', 0, NULL, 0),
(338, 'RADA Tech', 0, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #101010; font-family: \'Open Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 14.95px;\">Founder Name:&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 14.95px;\">Abdullah Afzal</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #101010; font-family: \'Open Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 14.95px;\">Domain/Area: &nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 14.95px;\">Automation&nbsp;<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #101010; font-family: \'Open Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 14.95px;\">Problem Statement/Opportunity:&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 14.95px; color: #626262; letter-spacing: 0.2pt;\">An intuitive sense of market dynamics and emerging trends has established us as a pioneer, leading the way with the most innovative technology on the market. From custom designed products to large-scale collection production .Our customer&rsquo;s need is our prime focus</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #101010; font-family: \'Open Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 14.95px;\">Solution/Abstract :&nbsp;</span></span>RADA Technologies is an automation based company, striving to provide best and easy solution to operate home appliances remotely and automatically based on sensors and feedback from human&nbsp; interaction with devices. We are a group of students from UET, the prestigious engineering We are a group of students from UET, the prestigious engineering institute of engineering we are planning to provide the doorstep and one window solution to all automation projects. Our products will be manufactured in Pakistan and are affordable to the middle class families. Our vision is to make home automation a commodity for every home by 2020, from offices to home, restaurants to robots and all the electrical appliances will work automatically, which include Fans, Lights, Exhausts, Air-Conditioners, Refrigerators and Cameras with Face detection security features.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #101010; font-family: \'Open Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 14.95px;\">USP: (Unique selling point&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 14.95px;\">:</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 14.95px;\">Our primary focus is to provide effective, high quality automation services, utilizing our highly qualified engineering resources.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #101010; font-family: \'Open Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 14.95px;\">Current</span></span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 14.95px;\">&nbsp;Customers:</span></span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 14.95px; color: #222222;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #101010; font-family: \'Open Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #222222; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">1.Polycon industries</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt; padding: 0px; color: #101010; font-family: \'Open Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #222222;\">2- Ittefaq Industries</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt; padding: 0px; color: #101010; font-family: \'Open Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #222222;\">3- Plan 9</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt; padding: 0px; color: #101010; font-family: \'Open Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #222222;\">4- Virtual Eye</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0.0001pt; padding: 0px; color: #101010; font-family: \'Open Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #222222;\">5- Smart Mirro</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #101010; font-family: \'Open Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 18.4px;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #101010; font-family: \'Open Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 18.4px;\">Monthly Sales:</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #101010; font-family: \'Open Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 18.4px;\">Annually Sales: 1,110,000 PKR</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #101010; font-family: \'Open Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 18.4px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 18.4px;\">Team Members:&nbsp; 5</span></span>&nbsp;</span></span></p>', 'Rada-Abdullah Afzal.jpg', 15, 0, 0, NULL, 'Startups', 0, NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO `kic_group_projectlist` (`projectlist_id`, `projectlist_Name`, `projectlist_seqno`, `projectlist_description`, `projectlist_small_picture`, `group_id`, `subgroup_id`, `sub_site_id`, `code`, `project_category`, `is_completed`, `fundedby`, `inactive`) VALUES
(339, 'eBolt; Hybrid Bike Simtaar', 0, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #101010; font-family: \'Open Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Founder Name</span>: Abdul Basit</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #101010; font-family: \'Open Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Total Team Members</span>: 3</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #101010; font-family: \'Open Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Domain/Area:</span>&nbsp;Automotive Industry</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #101010; font-family: \'Open Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Problem Statement:</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #222222; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp;The traditional motorbikes are not environment friendly and with the increase number of bikes on the road, our environment is affecting badly with air pollution and noise. Secondly, the maintenance of a typical bike needs a regular checkup with mechanic to keep on running condition.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #101010; font-family: \'Open Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Solution</span>: eBolt, an electric bike, is environment friendly machine and&nbsp;<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #303030; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">every mile you ride is putting massive savings into your pocket versus driving your traditional bike. The necessary electricity to charge them is minimal. In fact, the electricity costs of an e-bike are quite close to free. A general rule of thumb is that it costs almost nothing to power your bike for 50 kms of riding and works on lithium-ion batteries. eBolt also provides cruise control, abs brake system with the maximum speed of 60 km/h.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #101010; font-family: \'Open Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">USP:</span>&nbsp;Only Local Electrical Bike</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: #101010; font-family: \'Open Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Potential Customers:</span>&nbsp;B2C, Automotive Industry in B2B</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; color: #101010; font-family: \'Open Sans\', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Current Customers:</span>&nbsp;Individuals (90 Pre-Orders) worth Rs. 6 Million</span></p>', 'Ebolt-Abdul Basit.jpg', 15, 0, 0, NULL, 'Startups', 0, NULL, 0),
(342, 'PakStraw by PakVitae', 0, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">Founder Name:&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">Shayan Sohail</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">Domain/Area:&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">Water, Hardware/Health&nbsp;</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">Problem statement:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">Water Pollution&nbsp;<strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 7.5pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">Solution:</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 11.5pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;PakVitae provides life-time affordable filters that can purify water to 99.9999% without any power requirement. The company is currently working with NGOs, Government organizations, Army, educational and health institutes, and micro-entrepreneurs to bring clean affordable water to the people. The current target is Pakistani market via B2B sales for one year and then the company plans to launch the product in retail market. We are currently working on following solutions.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">USP:&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">Nanotech based Filter very small in size and extremely low in cost</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">Potential Customers:&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">People from all the demographics, particuluarly the inhabitants of underprivillged areas forced to drink filthy water</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">Achievments:&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">Won several international competitions and grants from donor bodies.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">Have raised around $6.5 Million from Hashoo Group,&nbsp; followed up by another 7 figure round coinvested by another firm.</span></p>', 'shyn.jpg', 15, 0, 0, NULL, 'Startups', 0, NULL, 0),
(343, 'Zombie Doom: FPS Headshot Carnage', 0, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Zombie Armageddon Shooter. An FPS zombie shooter game where you are task is to protect the last of humanity. Execute the zombie swarm and save everyone from the apocalypse. The infection will spread and everyone will turn into a monster unless you step up. The pandemic must be stopped from spreading. Clear the dungeon from all the walking dead before the swarm gets to you and others.</p>', 'iconn_.png', 24, 0, 0, NULL, 'Game', 1, NULL, 0),
(344, 'Train Crash: Train Driving Simulator', 0, '<p><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">Train crash train driving simulator is the latest cutting edge train driving simulator game that will allow you to make the citizens obey the laws of railroad crossing so that the accidents should be avoided.</span><br style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; color: #333333; font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\" /><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">Roam across different scenes and enjoy the thrilling environment of our new game</span></p>', 'ICON 512_512 (1).jpg', 24, 0, 0, NULL, 'Game', 1, NULL, 0),
(345, 'Christmas Maze Runner 3D', 0, '<p><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">In this Christmas Maze Runner 3D you are controlling a TPS runner and you have to</span><br style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; color: #333333; font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\" /><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">roam around the maze and find new ways to clear the maze. Collect exciting items on your way to the</span><br style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; color: #333333; font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\" /><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">end of the maze which helps you find the door to enter the next maze. Santa is waiting for you at the</span><br style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; color: #333333; font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\" /><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">end of the maze to please you with this year&rsquo;s Christmas gift. Enter the world of mazes and find exciting&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">new Aerox ways to clear the maze.</span></p>', 'iconn.png', 24, 0, 0, NULL, 'Game', 1, NULL, 0),
(346, 'Storm Destruction.io 2019', 0, '<p><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">In this Storm Destruction.io 2019 you are controlling a storm and you have to destroy the city. You can start with small to large objects to make your storm more powerful and strong. Compete with other AI players to beat them. The more you destroy the more you score. Destruction is the only goal of this game. The more disaster your storms causes the more you score. Destroy the city so you can score good to beat your rivals. Fight with your rivals and beat them</span></p>', 'icon.jpg', 24, 0, 0, NULL, 'Game', 1, NULL, 0),
(347, 'Death Rally 3D: Car Death Race 2019', 0, '<p><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">Death race an action game is here to bring you demolition car battles! Ride your cars, burnout the asphalts and wheels, shoot for revenge and skid traffic and destruction in the best car shooting games and gun games! Crash and burn your enemies in racing action battles, reach the goal &amp; survive</span></p>', '1.png', 24, 0, 0, NULL, 'Game', 1, NULL, 0),
(348, 'Wild Animals Racing: Racing Battle 2019', 0, '<p><span style=\"color: #333333; font-family: Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">This animal racing game is all about levels that have different objectives. Your mission in this game is to unlock different animals by winning the races and completing the objectives in any race. Completing objective will give you a 3 star ranking which will lead you to gain more rewards. Spend your coins to buy new wild animals and experience more wildness In the race. In this Jungle racing Run fast, jump higher to avoid the obstacle and finish the race first.</span></p>', 'animal_racing_.png', 24, 0, 0, NULL, 'Game', 1, NULL, 0),
(349, 'Car Rumble', 0, '<p>in this game you are connected with players through internet. choose your cars and battle with your friends. Last man standing will be the winner. There are different type of enviroments in which you can battle. choose your enviroment wisely invite your friends and beat them.</p>', '21111111111.png', 24, 0, 0, NULL, 'Game', 0, NULL, 0),
(350, 'BigFoot Beast Hunting', 0, '<p><span style=\"color: #111111; font-family: \'Amazon Ember\', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\">Strange sightings and disturbing disappearances have been occurring in the forest. People have reported seeing a scary monster, a giant beast that they can&rsquo;t explain. You set out to explore this creature in order to uncover its identity. To confirm its existence you decide to get a closer look. Soon your adventure turns into a quest for survival! You have to channel your inner hunter to defeat this evil and wicked beast.</span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: #111111; font-family: \'Amazon Ember\', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\" /><span style=\"color: #111111; font-family: \'Amazon Ember\', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\">UET Game Studio presents &ldquo;Beast Hunting: Summer Games&rdquo;; an exciting, adventurous hunting game to catch a giant monster .You have to find the Bigfoot beast and trap him. You have to be careful though, Bigfoot is wild! The Sasquatch is agitated and you have to be smart in drawing it out. Set up a trap and wait for the yeti to come out to get caught in the traps. Use weapons to protect yourself against this giant, scary beast. It isn&rsquo;t just a game. It is a game for your survival! You have to play your way through all the 10 dangerous and scary levels to first collect evidence to prove that the beast exists, track it down and trap him. You have to be the predator to defeat the predator.</span></p>', 'icon1.png', 24, 0, 0, NULL, 'Game', 1, NULL, 0),
(351, 'Third Party Validation of the project “Reconciliation of electricity billing using AMI meters in Punjab (Pilot Phase)” ', 0, '<p><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">AERIL-KICS provided third party validation consultancy services in order to assess and validate the objectives of project conducted by Reconciliation Cell department of Energy Department Punjab. Scope of work included validation of 10% of installed AMI meters inspection and data collection from all over Punjab installed under corresponding DISCO companies. Furthermore, monitoring software validation, report generation, billing units verification for all 1698 meters, and overbilling by WAPDA has been identified and reported to the Client. A comprehensive report has been delivered to client stating the current status of surveyed meters, analysis of overall software logged data, comparison of logged data with on-site meters functionality, report generations, billing units verification and estimated savings. Moreover, project impact assessment is also reported based on effectiveness, relevance and feedback from beneficiaries. Future recommendations are also included in the report.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',\'sans-serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">ACTIVITIES:</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Site surveys of more than 170 AMI meters for inspection all over Punjab</li>\r\n<li>DISCO wise analysis of units verification</li>\r\n<li>Software analysis and report generation verification</li>\r\n<li>Impact assessment (Effectiveness, relevance, objectives, feedback etc.)</li>\r\n<li>Comprehensive data analysis for different comparison reports</li>\r\n<li>Units verification of overall data recorded (for 1698 meters) by software since installation of AMI meters</li>\r\n<li>Future recommendations</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Project-icon.png', 11, 0, 0, NULL, 'Research', 1, NULL, 0),
(352, 'UET Web TV', 1, '<div>\r\n<p>University of engineering &amp; technology has been flourished to an extent where it has more than 4 sub campuses and over 8000 students. Producing creative and educative content UET News will cover the gap and it will serve as a dedicated media cell of UET. The basic objectives of UET News are to</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Promote the idea of using technology as an academic platform.</li>\r\n<li>Produce and broadcast programs where knowledge, curiosity innovation and entrepreneurship will be the key for talented people around.</li>\r\n<li>Promote the research based projects of UET.</li>\r\n<li>Highlight Campus life and student activities.</li>\r\n<li>Provide an effective communication tool to administration and students.</li>\r\n<li>Encourage students to take part in discussion and debate focusing on youth.</li>\r\n<li>Provide training to the students seeking career in broadcast journalism.</li>\r\n<li>To address the critical need for improving communication with the stakeholders.</li>\r\n<li>And much more.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>', 'uet_news.png', 33, 0, 0, NULL, 'Research', 0, NULL, 0),
(353, 'Bioloid Humanoid Robot with Computer Vision', 4, '<p>It is Ultralight and high strength of aluminum framed robot, which is to be built, It can be programmed with simple IDE and it can also be controlled via wireless remote controller of Zigbee module. Its working can also be viewd on 3d motion animator with inverse kinemati Engine. It is usually programmed with Visual C tool.</p>', '1200px-Bioloid_humanoid_robot.jpg', 25, 0, 0, NULL, 'Research', 0, NULL, 0),
(354, 'Collaborative Robots', 1, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium; line-height: 107%;\"><strong>Collaborative robots</strong> allow safe physical interaction and synergistically share the workspace with other robots and human co-workers. These robots can be efficiently programmed by means of physical stimuli and percepts without extensive reconfigurability of their hardware or software components. The lab is indigenously developing a 7-DOF collaborative robot for typical industrial applications. Its design has been systematically evolved from the successful realization of its smaller versions: 3-DOF planar writing manipulator followed 5-DOF non-planar manipulator for pick-and-place task. The collaborative feature has been introduced by means of an impedance control scheme as well as exploiting redundancy for added compliance. The final product, a 7-DOF collaborative manipulator is expected to meet the modern needs of the national industry.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium; line-height: 107%;\"><br /></span></p>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://www.kics.edu.pk/kics_pms/documents/labs/gallery/cobots.JPG\" alt=\"\" /></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', 'unnamed.jpg', 36, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0),
(355, 'Industrial Exoskeletons', 2, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium; line-height: 107%;\"><strong>Exoskeletons</strong> are wearable robotic suits for assisting humans in everyday tasks or post-stroke rehabilitation. These are designed to reduce muscle fatigue by minimizing the contact force between the human body and exoskeleton hardware while ensuring wearability, safety, ergonomics, and device power consumption. The lab is developing both passive and active upper-limb exoskeletons for assisting repetitive industrial tasks. The passive type is in the form of a fully functional gravity compensator, whereas an active exoskeleton that amplifies power along with multiple directions, is being currently developed using 4-DOF powered actuators. These are controlled by sensing the intention of its wearer and translating it into actuator-motion. The deployment of these exoskeletons is expected to increase the throughput of our industry workforce.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://www.kics.edu.pk/kics_pms/documents/labs/gallery/1_Exoskeletons.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" /></td>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://www.kics.edu.pk/kics_pms/documents/labs/gallery/1_Exoskeletons.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"400\" /></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '2.jpg', 36, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0),
(356, 'Active Prostheses', 3, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><strong>Active prostheses</strong> compensate the patients for mobility impairments caused by partly or fully dysfunctional links. In spite of the rapid technological advances, prosthetic devices find it difficult to lower metabolic costs to their wearers and do not provide for seamless switching between limb activities. The lab is focusing on the design and the development of lower-limb prostheses with specific emphasis on the design and development of (i) active ankle-foot (ii) data acquisition system for objective gait assessment and evaluation using multiple wearable sensors, and (iii) active knee. The first two projects are nearing their completion, whereas the active knee, after the finalization of its design, has been dispatched for fabrication. The control of these devices relies on varying controller gains at the run time to optimize metabolic energy and smoother migration from one activity (or its constituent phase to another). These lower-limb prostheses are expected to substantially ameliorate amputee&rsquo;s life.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<table>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><img src=\"https://www.kics.edu.pk/kics_pms/documents/labs/gallery/active_prosthesis.JPG\" alt=\"\" /></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>', '3.jpg', 36, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0),
(358, 'VR based neurogaming for mindfulness in children and ADHD patients', 0, '<p>Attention-deficit/hyperactivity disorder (ADHD) is a brain disorder targeting millions of children every year. It affects the cognitive abilities of children such as hyperactivity disorder, difficulty focusing, inattentiveness, and impulsive behaviors. The National Institute of Mental Health (NIMH) estimated that about 7.1% of children and adolescents are diagnosed as ADHD each year [1]. In Pakistan prevalence of ADHD is 1,931,426 from total population which is estimated to be 159,196,336 [1]. Lack of proper treatment can persist these disorders till adulthood with even more severe effects. The lack of skilled psychiatrist and mental health services for children&rsquo;s in Pakistan is a serious concern [2], which has led to a significant number of unidentified cases. According to the World Health Organization (WHO), Assessment Instrument for Mental health Systems (WHO-AIMS), there is a total of 3729 mental health services in Pakistan, among them only 1% are for children and teenagers [3]. The aim of this project is to fill the gap in existing medical health services for child mental health care in Pakistan and to provide an efficient, readily available solution to parents and in schools for improvement in their cognitive abilities.</p>\r\n<p>The output of this project will be in the form of different gaming applications controlled from the brain dubbed as neurogaming in which feedback from brain signals will be used as input in Virtual Reality (VR) environment. This system will have its impact on education as well as in the health sector, by providing better facilities to the patients. This system is deemed to contribute to the development of mental health institutes and for improving the health conditions of the children in Pakistan.</p>', 'Project-icon.png', 8, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0),
(359, 'BioDataExploiter: A Semantic Search Engine Based on Formalization and Semantic Integration of Heterogeneous Omics Annotations for Knowledge Extraction', 1, '<p align=\"justify\">BioDataExploiter is a semantic search engine for performing aspect-based querying on integrated omics annotations. This project has two main functional components. First, heterogeneous and geographically dispersed omics annotations are integrated and warehoused in our RDF-based Integrated Omics Quad Store (IOQS). IOQS is built on our proposed formal data integration model and capable enough to persist integrated annotations in a unified manner. Based on IOQS, second component enables end users to perform aspect based querying through three data access interfaces (1) web query interface provides querying facility through typing or selecting different graphical query interface components (2) web services interface enables end users to integrate their online systems for bulks data access (3) application programming interface provides data access interface for especially those applications which require offline and freestanding data processing. BioDataExploiter provides web-based and downloadable query results in the form of interconnected database entities as data systematically generates in a human cellular system.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Available at:</strong></p>\r\n<p><strong>1)</strong> Web Query Interface</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;URL: <a href=\"http://BioDataExploiter.uet.edu.pk:9095/WebQueryInterface/search.jsp\" target=\"_blank\">http://BioDataExploiter.uet.edu.pk:9095/WebQueryInterface/search.jsp</a></p>\r\n<p><strong>2)</strong> Web Service Interface&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;URL: <a href=\"http://BioDataExploiter.uet.edu.pk:9095/WebServiceInterface/BDEWebService?wsdl\" target=\"_blank\">http://BioDataExploiter.uet.edu.pk:9095/WebServiceInterface/BDEWebService?wsdl</a></p>', 'logo_jpg.jpg', 8, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0),
(360, 'Integrated Security Framework for Next Generation Industries', 1, '<p style=\"line-height: 1.2; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">IIoT (Industrial Internet of Things) is fairly a new concept for industries, and it is presenting a huge opportunity in helping enterprises to operate more productively while improving efficiency and reducing costs. Gartner recently estimated that there were 4.8 billion IIoT assets in the world at the end of 2019, and expects that number will grow by 21 percent in 2020. &nbsp;Security challenges for IT/OT (IIoT) convergence are the biggest concern as the breaches affect both individuals and organizations vulnerable to financial and operational damage. Talos pointed out that they published 87 advisories about vulnerabilities in IoT and ICS devices in 2019. If security capability is considered in the selection criteria, then the main challenge is the lack of comprehensive cybersecurity solutions.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.2; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.2; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">We propose a comprehensive cybersecurity solution for IIoT as a whole. Key features of our proposed solution that give it a security edge from existing security solutions are:</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.2; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.2; background-color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Threat Modelling - Potential threats identification in an IIoT use-case.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Log Analyzer &ndash; System Level &amp; Network level, log gathering mechanism for IIoT devices.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-size: 11pt; background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Endpoint Detection and Response</span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; background-color: transparent; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;- Sandbox malicious files in an IIoT network.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Compliance Check - IIoT assets compliance verification.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Intrusion Detection System - Detect anomalies in IIoT protocols communication.</span></li>\r\n</ul>', 'GettyImages-1156136082.jpg', 16, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0),
(361, 'A secure framework to provide IoT firmware update', 2, '<p style=\"line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify; margin-top: 4pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-1ff9f868-7fff-81ae-9674-2ae80b497e54\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">The update process in IoT devices is a hectic and non-standardized process. Different vendors use their own protocols for updating their IoT devices firmware. The update mechanisms are either buggy or lack the basic security requirements whereas certain vendors do not even provide a facility of OTA update. Researchers have contributed several methods to update the firmware of IoT devices automatically but the versatility of IoT devices makes it difficult to standardize the solution. Our idea is to come up with a standardized and secure update mechanism based on the resourcefulness of IoT devices. The solution will also test the firmware for any security shortcomings.</span></span></p>', 'deception-technology-2.jpg', 16, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0),
(362, 'Next Generation Deception based Cyber Defense Solution', 3, '<p style=\"line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify; margin-top: 4pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri,sans-serif; color: #666666; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">With every passing day we hear about new technologies and security solutions but then again new attacks emerge, which means, no security solution can stop all attacks from occurring on a network. Existing cyber technologies, including firewalls and end-point security, cannot defend with 100% security and attackers can still penetrate the networks to steal data or damage the system. Deception technology is an emerging category of Cyber security defense that can provide an additional layer of security&nbsp; to detect, analyze, and defend against advanced attacks in real-time.</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: #666666; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; white-space: pre-wrap;\">In this project, we are proposing to develop a &ldquo;Next-Generation Deception Solution&rdquo; that will effectively and quickly detect the threats and will increase the incident response effectiveness dramatically. In an organization that uses mature and advanced security platforms or where they have less sophisticated controls of security, the next-gen deception will be a great and effective solution to defend against threats that have been lurking in the system. The Next-Gen Deception Technology will create real and interactive OS decoys with the emulated services, including Enterprise IoT devices to identify attacker and malware&rsquo;s activities. It will also provide the helping hands in incident response and threat hunting purposes.</span></p>', 'The-Next-Generation-of-EDR.png', 16, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0),
(363, '2D / 3D Acoustic Based Target Locating System', 1, '<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; color: #0e101a; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\" lang=\"EN-US\">Acoustic-based Gun-shot Detection and Localization in 3D, object tracking and camera handover for safe cities, border forces, and private organizations</span></p>', 'Project-icon.png', 5, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0),
(366, 'Go Global', 0, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">We are an amazing internet, fun loving travel management company to let you experience the Global Places in a managed way &amp; a very affordable plan.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Let us give you memorable experience through an excellent travel related service. </span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Be Global with Go Global</span></p>', 'up1.jpg', 15, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0),
(368, 'The Boosters', 0, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Boost your Business to the next level. We are the only aerial advertising company in Pakistan.</span></p>', 'up2.jpg', 15, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0),
(369, 'Magnus Tech', 0, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Drive to a gas station? No thanks! TOWARDS A CLEANER FUTURE, POWERED BY YOU.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">We manufacture and assemble two-wheeler in Pakistan. Magnus Electric aims to provide a pollution free and healthy environment by creating products that help the world transition to a cleaner cheaper and efficient ride.</span></p>', 'uo3.jpg', 15, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0),
(370, 'Kaon Tech', 0, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Kaon Technologies is focused on improving the occupational health and safety by</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">efficient monitoring and engineering services. Our mission is to achieve sustainable and</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">eco-friendly environment through ultimate monitoring of Industrial hygiene. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Every day at Kaon Technologies, we work hard to achieve our aim of becoming number one in client lifetime experience. Our vision for our global team is to be a world-class, dynamic provider of innovative technologies.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '4.jpg', 15, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0),
(371, 'Paint Pandas', 0, '<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">We aim to provide painting service to our customer at a reasonable price we are looking forward to work on augmented reality so they can visualize how their wall will look like before even the wall is painted. we are providing wallpaper, pvc, mural art, graffiti, paint. we have mission to provide the finest quality of paint service with free inspection in Lahore initially.</span></p>', '6.jpg', 15, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0),
(372, 'Rishtedari	', 0, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Matrimonial App: Providing you an exceptional matchmaking experience wrapped in reliability, trust and guarantee</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '7.jpg', 15, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0),
(373, 'Spark PCB	', 0, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Printed Circuit Board manufacturing service in Pakistan</span></p>', '8.jpg', 15, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0),
(374, 'Quantum Motors 	', 0, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">We create state of the art and high performance EV&rsquo;s.</span></p>', '9.jpg', 15, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0),
(375, 'Talent Pool HR', 0, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">To help Tech Start-Ups build and establish their HR Department. Also, we help them build their dream team either be technical or non-technical while they can solely focus on the other important sides of their business and clients.</span><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"></strong></p>', '09.jpg', 15, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0),
(376, 'Travello	', 0, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">we will provide backpackers a travel bag with portable and customized essential items that they will need during their travel journey at low cost but of high quality</span></p>', 'Project-icon.png', 15, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0),
(377, 'XORTEX ', 0, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">AI Designer <span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>\"The name derived from Visual Cortex which is the primary cortical region of the brain that receives, integrates, and processes visual information relayed from the retinas. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">XORTEX aims at providing AI-Driven solutions where we employ deep learning algorithms paired with computer vision systems to build solutions that unlock the value of visual based data across a variety of industries and use cases.\"</span></p>', 'Project-icon.png', 15, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0),
(378, 'Language Engineering Lab (National Center in Big Data and Cloud Computing) (Funded by HEC)', 0, '<p style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">The Language Data Engineering Lab (LEL) at Al-Khawarizmi Institute of Computer Science (KICS) </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">aims to build an ecosystem for Urdu </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">based content and analytics services to empower Pakistani citizens for their socio-economic </span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">benefit and enable business and government for strategic decision making. </span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br /></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: large; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: transparent; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Main Goals of Project</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Providing effective access to online and additional Urdu content.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Releasing Urdu language processing toolkit for accelerating research and development of Urdu language technology.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px; background-color: transparent; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Delivering data analytics based on local users and local content for improving decision making for business and e-governance.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt; text-wrap: wrap;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.6667px;\">Making available specific cloud based services using the Urdu data analytics available to address current academic and public requirements</span></span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; font-size: 11pt; text-wrap: wrap;\">.</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;</p>', 'Project-icon.png', 7, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0),
(379, 'Debunking Multimodal Propaganda using Artificial Intelligence in Digital Landscape of Pakistan (Funder by NRPU, HEC)', 0, '<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">The swift spread of propaganda content through digital media has raised significant concerns for governments and civil societies worldwide because of its negative effects. Pakistan is also affected by this issue. Consequently, our project seeks to develop an Artificial Intelligence (AI) model to identify multimodal propaganda. The primary objectives of our project are as follows:</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Design and develop a Artificial Intelligence based system explore the digital landscape of Pakistan to detect the propaganda and misinformation</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Develop essential resources and tools to detect and process the online misinformation</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Design and release a public dashboard disseminate the analysis of propaganda online content</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Develop services to detect the online users spreading misinformation.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>', 'Project-icon.png', 7, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0),
(419, 'Development of Urdu Test Material for Hearing Impaired Community ', 0, '<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>To develop the standardized test batteries for the speech audiometric testing in Pakistan</li>\r\n<li>To develop the standardized Urdu word lists by inculcating the linguistic and speech audiometry knowledge.</li>\r\n<li>To facilitate the proper audiological and speech diagnosis by developing the test materials for SRT and WRS.</li>\r\n<li>To facilitate excellent education systems for the deaf through the development of these test materials.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 'Project-icon.png', 10, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0),
(420, 'Enhancement of Nafees Nastaleeq Font', 0, '<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Enhancement of Nafees Nastaleeq font by adding support for rendering 43 additional characters. </span></p>', 'Project-icon.png', 10, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0),
(421, 'Automatic Meeting Minutes and Analytics Generation for Urdu', 0, '<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\"></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>To design and develop an intelligent meeting notes-taker for Punjabi accent Urdu &amp; English speakers.</li>\r\n<li>To design and develop speech separation systems to detect and separate overlapping speech which can further be used for speech-based applications.</li>\r\n<li>To design and develop a meeting speech corpus consisting of 15 hours of speech from multiple speakers.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\"></span></p>', 'Project-icon.png', 10, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, 0),
(422, 'Language Engineering Lab', 0, '<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Providing effective access to online and additional Urdu content</li>\r\n<li>Releasing Urdu language processing toolkit for accelerating research and development of Urdu language technology</li>\r\n<li>Delivering data analytics based on local users and local content for improving decision making for business and e-governance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Making available specific cloud based services using the Urdu data analytics available to address current academic and public requirements. </span></p>', 'Project-icon.png', 10, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0),
(423, 'DigSal - Addressing the Digital Divide for South Asian Languages', 0, '<p><span style=\"font-size: small;\">Narrow the digital gap by enhancing access to computational resources and linguistic understanding for South Asian languages. </span></p>', 'Project-icon.png', 10, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, 0),
(424, 'test', 12, 'testt', '', 3, 0, 0, 'test', 'Researchh', 0, NULL, 0),
(425, 'KICS PMS PROJECT', 1, 'ADMIN DASHBOARD AND WEBSITE OF KICS', '', 39, 0, 0, 'KPMS', 'R&D', 0, NULL, 0);
