nd-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">This\r\n  3-month Full Stack JavaScript (MEAN/MERN) course enables trainees to develop\r\n  complete web applications using modern JavaScript technologies. The\r\n  curriculum includes front-end development with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, and\r\n  advanced frameworks such as React or Angular. On the back-end, trainees learn\r\n  Node.js, Express, and MongoDB to build APIs and manage databases. By the end\r\n  of the course, students develop and deploy a complete full-stack project,\r\n  gaining the skills required for internships, freelancing, and entry-level web\r\n  development positions</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;\r\n  mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;\r\n  color:#525252\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"3%\" valign=\"bottom\" style=\"width: 3.4%; border-width: 1pt; border-color: black; border-image: none; padding: 0cm;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;\r\n  margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:6.0pt;text-align:center;line-height:150%;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\n  font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#525252\">8<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"29%\" valign=\"bottom\" style=\"width: 29.08%; border-width: 1pt; border-color: black; border-image: none; padding: 0cm;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;\r\n  margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:6.0pt;text-align:center;line-height:150%;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\n  font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#525252;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0cm;padding:0cm\">Advance Web Development <o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"66%\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 66.6%; border-width: 1pt; border-color: black; border-image: none; padding: 0cm;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\n  margin-left:6.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(82, 82, 82); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">HTML5,\r\n  CSS3, JavaScript, jQuery, PHP, MySQL, AJAX, and modern frameworks like\r\n  Bootstrap and Laravel. Learners will develop skills in both frontend and\r\n  backend development, including creating dynamic websites, performing CRUD\r\n  operations, building RESTful APIs, and developing full projects like CRUD\r\n  apps and gallery systems using Laravel.</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\n  font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#525252\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"99%\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"bottom\" style=\"width: 99.54%; border-width: 1pt; border-color: black; border-image: none; background: rgb(242, 242, 242); padding: 0cm;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:\r\n  107%;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#525252\">Intermediate preferably with\r\n  science and above</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"3%\" valign=\"bottom\" style=\"width: 3.4%; border-width: 1pt; border-color: black; border-image: none; background: rgb(242, 242, 242); padding: 0cm;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;\r\n  margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:6.0pt;text-align:center;line-height:150%;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\n  font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#525252\">9<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"29%\" valign=\"bottom\" style=\"width: 29.08%; border-width: 1pt; border-color: black; border-image: none; background: rgb(242, 242, 242); padding: 0cm;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;\r\n  margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:6.0pt;text-align:center;line-height:150%;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\n  font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#525252;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0cm;padding:0cm\">Digital Marketing &amp; SEO 3\r\n  Months<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"66%\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 66.6%; border-width: 1pt; border-color: black; border-image: none; background: rgb(242, 242, 242); padding: 0cm;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\n  margin-left:6.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(82, 82, 82); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">This\r\n  practical training course teaches skills in online marketing, SEO, social\r\n  media, and content creation. It covers keyword research, on-page and off-page\r\n  SEO, PPC, email, and YouTube marketing, preparing students for freelancing\r\n  and digital business opportunities.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"3%\" valign=\"bottom\" style=\"width: 3.4%; border-width: 1pt; border-color: black; border-image: none; background: rgb(242, 242, 242); padding: 0cm;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;\r\n  margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:6.0pt;text-align:center;line-height:150%;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\n  font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#525252\">10<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"29%\" valign=\"bottom\" style=\"width: 29.08%; border-width: 1pt; border-color: black; border-image: none; background: rgb(242, 242, 242); padding: 0cm;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;\r\n  margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:6.0pt;text-align:center;line-height:150%;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\n  font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#525252;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0cm;padding:0cm\">Graphic Design (Print Media)\r\n  3 Months<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"66%\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 66.6%; border-width: 1pt; border-color: black; border-image: none; background: rgb(242, 242, 242); padding: 0cm;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\n  margin-left:6.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#525252;background:white\">Professional\r\n  training focused on design principles, color theory, typography, and software\r\n  skills in Adobe Illustrator, Photoshop, and CorelDRAW. It emphasizes hands-on\r\n  projects, portfolio development, and branding materials to prepare trainees\r\n  for freelancing or jobs in advertising, publishing, and printing industries</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(82, 82, 82); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"3%\" valign=\"bottom\" style=\"width: 3.4%; border-width: 1pt; border-color: black; border-image: none; background: rgb(242, 242, 242); padding: 0cm;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;\r\n  margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:6.0pt;text-align:center;line-height:200%;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\n  font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#525252\">11<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"29%\" valign=\"bottom\" style=\"width: 29.08%; border-width: 1pt; border-color: black; border-image: none; background: rgb(242, 242, 242); padding: 0cm;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;\r\n  margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:6.0pt;text-align:center;line-height:200%;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\n  font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#525252;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0cm;padding:0cm\">Industrial Automation (PLC) 6\r\n  Months</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:\r\n  &quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n  Arial;color:#525252\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"66%\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 66.6%; border-width: 1pt; border-color: black; border-image: none; background: rgb(242, 242, 242); padding: 0cm;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\n  margin-left:6.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(82, 82, 82); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">This\r\n  course focuses on programmable logic controllers (PLCs), ladder logic\r\n  programming, sensors, relays, and automation systems. The course emphasizes\r\n  80% hands-on training, covering PLC software, analog/digital I/O,\r\n  troubleshooting, HMI design, and entrepreneurship skills</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#525252\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"3%\" valign=\"bottom\" style=\"width: 3.4%; border-width: 1pt; border-color: black; border-image: none; padding: 0cm;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;\r\n  margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:6.0pt;text-align:center;line-height:200%;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\n  font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#525252\">12<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"29%\" valign=\"bottom\" style=\"width: 29.08%; border-width: 1pt; border-color: black; border-image: none; padding: 0cm;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;\r\n  margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:6.0pt;text-align:center;line-height:200%;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:200%;\r\n  font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#525252;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0cm;padding:0cm\">Renewable Energy (Solar) 3\r\n  Months</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:200%;font-family:\r\n  &quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n  Arial;color:#525252\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"66%\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 66.6%; border-width: 1pt; border-color: black; border-image: none; padding: 0cm;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\n  margin-left:6.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(82, 82, 82); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Three-months\r\n  hands-on program designed to develop employable skills in solar and wind\r\n  energy systems. It covers solar panel installation, system design, wind\r\n  turbine operation, and energy efficiency management. The course includes\r\n  practical training, safety, job search, and entrepreneurship modules</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#525252\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"3%\" valign=\"bottom\" style=\"width: 3.4%; border-width: 1pt; border-color: black; border-image: none; background: rgb(242, 242, 242); padding: 0cm;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;\r\n  margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:6.0pt;text-align:center;line-height:150%;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\n  font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#525252\">13<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"29%\" valign=\"bottom\" style=\"width: 29.08%; border-width: 1pt; border-color: black; border-image: none; background: rgb(242, 242, 242); padding: 0cm;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;\r\n  margin-bottom:0cm;margin-left:6.0pt;text-align:center;line-height:150%;\r\n  vertical-align:baseline\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\n  font-family:&quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\n  mso-bidi-font-family:Arial;color:#525252;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-alt:none windowtext 0cm;padding:0cm\">Solar PV System Technician 3\r\n  Months</span></b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:\r\n  &quot;inherit&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n  Arial;color:#525252\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"66%\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 66.6%; border-width: 1pt; border-color: black; border-image: none; background: rgb(242, 242, 242); padding: 0cm;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;\r\n  margin-left:6.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#525252;background:white\">The\r\n  Solar PV System Technician course teaches students how to install, maintain,\r\n  and fix solar power systems, helping them become professional solar\r\n  technicians.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table></div></div><div class=\"contact-bar\">\r\n</div>', '2026-07-09 09:42:19', '2026-08-12 03:16:23');
INSERT INTO `news` (`id`, `category_id`, `title`, `thumbnail`, `image`, `description`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(29, 1, 'Summer Internship Program 2026', 'new/1785130780_6a66ef1c7fc84.png', 'news/1783598534_6a4f8dc67fde9.png', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:normal;mso-outline-level:1\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-size: 12pt;\">We are\r\npleased to invite applications for the Summer Internship Program 2026 at The\r\nAl-Khawarizmi Institute of Computer Science (KICS), UET Lahore. This internship\r\nprovides students with an opportunity to gain practical experience, enhance\r\ntheir professional skills, and work alongside experienced professionals in a\r\ndynamic learning environment.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:normal;mso-outline-level:2\"><b><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:\r\n18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-GB\">Eligibility Criteria</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:normal;mso-outline-level:2\"><b><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:\r\n18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-GB\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\n     line-height:normal;mso-list:l1 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\">BS\r\n     or MS active students<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:normal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\r\n&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:\r\nEN-GB\">Students from all academic disciplines are encouraged to apply.</span></b><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:normal;mso-outline-level:2\"><b><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:\r\n18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-GB\">Internship Details</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:normal;mso-outline-level:2\"><b><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:\r\n18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-GB\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\n     line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><b><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\">Duration:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\"> 2 months<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\n     line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><b><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\">Type:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\">\r\n     Unpaid Internship<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\n     line-height:normal;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo2;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><b><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\">Certificate:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\"> An\r\n     Experience Certificate will be awarded upon the successful completion of\r\n     the internship.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:normal;mso-outline-level:2\"><b><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:\r\n18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-GB\">Application Procedure</span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\">Interested\r\ncandidates are requested to submit the following documents via email to </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\"><a href=\"mailto:hr@kics.edu.pk\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">hr@kics.edu.pk</span></a></span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">:</span><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\n     line-height:normal;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\">Updated\r\n     Curriculum Vitae (CV)<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\n     line-height:normal;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\">Educational\r\n     Background<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\n     line-height:normal;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\">Current\r\n     CGPA<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\n     line-height:normal;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo3;tab-stops:list 36.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\n     mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\">Area\r\n     of Interest / Specialization<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:normal;mso-outline-level:2\"><b><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:\r\n18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-GB\">Application Deadline</span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nmargin-left:36.0pt;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-GB\">17<sup>th</sup> July 2026<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:normal;mso-outline-level:2\"><b><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:\r\n18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;\r\nmso-fareast-language:EN-GB\">Selection Process</span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\">Only\r\nshortlisted candidates will be contacted for an interview.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;\r\nline-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-GB\">We\r\nencourage enthusiastic, motivated, and talented students to apply and become\r\npart of our Summer Internship Program 2026.<o:p></o:p></span></p>', '2026-07-09 10:02:14', '2026-07-27 03:39:40');
INSERT INTO `news` (`id`, `category_id`, `title`, `thumbnail`, `image`, `description`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(30, 1, 'Emerging Tech Summer Bootcamp 2026 – Registrations Now Open', 'new/1785130962_6a66efd2045e6.jpg', 'news/1783669260_6a50a20c4c2ad.jpg', '<h2 data-section-id=\"1l90xhm\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"66\" class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><span style=\"color: rgb(19, 40, 67); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400;\">Al-Khawarizmi Institute of Computer Science (KICS), University of Engineering &amp; Technology (UET) Lahore, is pleased to announce the </span><strong data-start=\"200\" data-end=\"247\" style=\"color: rgb(19, 40, 67); font-size: 14px;\">Emerging Tech Summer Bootcamp 2026 (Hybrid)</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(19, 40, 67); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400;\">. This bootcamp is designed to equip students and professionals with practical, industry-relevant skills in today\'s most in-demand technologies.</span></h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"393\" data-end=\"491\">Participants will receive hands-on training from experienced instructors in the following domains:</p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"493\" data-end=\"671\">\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1tdp0ty\" data-start=\"493\" data-end=\"542\">\r\n🤖 Generative AI &amp; Large Language Models (LLMs)\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1mpaww5\" data-start=\"543\" data-end=\"580\">\r\n🔐 Cyber Security &amp; Ethical Hacking\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"124omds\" data-start=\"581\" data-end=\"629\">\r\n💻 AI-Powered Software Development with DevOps\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1van9t7\" data-start=\"630\" data-end=\"671\">\r\n☁️ Cloud Computing &amp; Big Data Analytics\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"673\" data-end=\"872\">The program focuses on practical learning, real-world projects, industry exposure, and networking opportunities. Upon successful completion, participants will receive a <strong data-start=\"842\" data-end=\"871\">Certificate of Completion</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"9u1hkg\" data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"897\">🌐 Official Website</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"898\" data-end=\"986\">For complete details about the bootcamp, curriculum, schedule, and fee structure, visit:</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"1021\"><strong data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"1021\"><a data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1019\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_new\" class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https://bootcamp.kics.edu.pk/\">https://bootcamp.kics.edu.pk/</a></strong></p>\r\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1fvw1vl\" data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1047\">📝 Registration Form</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"1048\" data-end=\"1092\">Register now using the official Google Form:</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1197\"><strong data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1197\"><a data-start=\"1096\" data-end=\"1195\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_new\" class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeZqxbyeB2XVz4ZRhFYzru01d9pvFKeywSaSLbbqi1fKt9JPA/viewform\">https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeZqxbyeB2XVz4ZRhFYzru01d9pvFKeywSaSLbbqi1fKt9JPA/viewform</a></strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1364\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">📢 <strong data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1326\">Limited seats are available. Register today and take the next step toward building your future in emerging technologies.</strong></p><p data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1364\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><img src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" data-filename=\"updated poster_page-0001 (1).jpg\" style=\"width: 760px;\"><strong data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1326\"><br></strong></p><p data-start=\"1199\" data-end=\"1364\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"></p>', '2026-07-10 05:35:14', '2026-07-27 03:42:42');
INSERT INTO `news` (`id`, `category_id`, `title`, `thumbnail`, `image`, `description`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(31, 1, 'KICS, UET Lahore Holds Board of Governors Meeting to Review Institutional Progress', 'new/1787894201_6a9119b989f52.png', NULL, '<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Montserrat, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-size: 16px; text-align: justify;\">Board of Governors Meeting | Al-Khawarizmi Institute of Computer Science (KICS), UET Lahore</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Montserrat, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-size: 16px; text-align: justify;\">A meeting of the Board of Governors of KICS, UET Lahore, was chaired by Chairman BOG KICS &amp; Vice Chancellor UET Lahore, Prof. Dr. Shahid Munir. The Board reviewed key institutional matters, while Director KICS, Prof. Dr. Shahzad Asif, apprised the members of the budget and financial progress.</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Montserrat, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; margin-bottom: 0px; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-size: 16px; text-align: justify;\">The meeting was attended by Member BOG Dr. Naveed Malik along with representatives from the Higher Education Department (HED) and the Finance Department.</div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Montserrat, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; margin-bottom: 0px; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-size: 16px; text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" data-filename=\"KICS-UET-Lahore-Holds-Board-of-Governors-Meeting-to-Review-Institutional-Progress2.png\" style=\"width: 760px;\"><br></div>', '2026-08-28 00:16:41', '2026-08-28 00:16:41');
INSERT INTO `news` (`id`, `category_id`, `title`, `thumbnail`, `image`, `description`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(32, 1, 'KICS UET Lahore Launches Huawei High-Tech Training Program – Batch II in Collaboration with NAVTTC, Huawei and CyberVision', 'new/1789021066_6aa24b8a90a2f.jpg', NULL, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">Al-Khawarizmi\r\nInstitute of Computer Science (KICS), University of Engineering and Technology\r\n(UET) Lahore, successfully organized the orientation ceremony for the Huawei\r\nHigh-Tech Training Program – Batch II on 07 September 2026 at KICS, UET Lahore.\r\nThe program is being delivered in collaboration with Huawei and CyberVision\r\nunder the framework of the Prime Minister’s Youth Skill Development Program\r\n(PMYSDP). The initiative aims to provide young people with advanced,\r\nmarket-oriented and internationally relevant technical skills in areas\r\nincluding Cloud Computing, Artificial Intelligence and Solution Architecture.\r\nThrough a combination of classroom learning, practical laboratory work,\r\nprofessional certification preparation and industry exposure, the program is\r\nintended to help participants develop the technical knowledge and professional\r\ncapabilities required for employment in the rapidly changing digital economy.\r\nThe orientation ceremony marked the formal beginning of Batch II and provided\r\nthe selected trainees with a clear understanding of the program structure,\r\nacademic expectations, training methodology, certification pathway and\r\nprofessional standards that will be followed throughout the training period. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">The\r\nceremony began in a respectful and traditional manner with the recitation of\r\nthe Holy Quran by Hafiz Yaseen, followed by a Naat presented by Hafiz Zain. The\r\nNational Anthem was also played as part of the opening proceedings. The opening\r\nsegment created a formal and welcoming environment for the participants,\r\ninstructors, management and administrative team attending the orientation. The\r\nevent was designed not only to introduce the courses but also to establish the\r\nlevel of seriousness, discipline and commitment expected from the trainees\r\nduring the program. Students were informed that the opportunity should be\r\nviewed as a professional development journey rather than simply a short-term\r\ntraining course. They were encouraged to become active learners, participate\r\nfully in practical work, communicate with their instructors, follow\r\ninstitutional guidelines and use the available learning resources effectively.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">The\r\nlaunch of Huawei High-Tech Training Program – Batch II builds upon the strong\r\nexperience and outcomes of the earlier Huawei training initiative conducted at\r\nKICS UET Lahore. The previous Huawei HCCDA Batch I program successfully\r\nenrolled 100 trainees across four structured cohorts in Huawei HCCDA Tech\r\nEssentials and Artificial Intelligence tracks. The program produced 90 globally\r\nrecognized Huawei certifications, demonstrating the strong commitment of both\r\nthe instructional team and participating students toward international\r\nprofessional certification. The previous batch also recorded encouraging\r\nemployment outcomes, with more than 60 percent of trainees securing employment\r\nopportunities during the training period in roles such as Cloud Developer, Artificial\r\nIntelligence Engineer and DevOps professional. These results demonstrated the\r\nimportance of combining technical education with practical exposure,\r\ncertification preparation and career development activities. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">The\r\nprevious training program also provided students with learning opportunities\r\nbeyond regular classroom lectures. Participants were exposed to industry talks,\r\ncareer counseling activities, practical cloud deployments, capstone projects,\r\ndemo days, professional presentations and real-world pitching experiences. Such\r\nactivities were designed to strengthen communication, problem-solving, teamwork\r\nand technical presentation skills along with core technical knowledge. The\r\nsuccess of the earlier initiative created a strong foundation for Batch II and\r\nencouraged KICS UET Lahore and its partners to continue developing training\r\nmodels that connect professional education with industry requirements. The new\r\nbatch therefore aims not only to prepare trainees for Huawei certification\r\nexaminations but also to strengthen their ability to apply knowledge in\r\npractical situations and understand how modern technologies are used in real\r\norganizations.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">During\r\nthe orientation ceremony, Prof. Dr. Hafiz Muhammad Shahzad Asif, Director KICS\r\nUET Lahore, delivered the welcome address and shared an important message with\r\nthe new trainees. He highlighted the growing importance of hands-on technical\r\neducation, practical skills and internationally recognized professional\r\ncertifications in today’s employment market. He explained that academic\r\nknowledge alone is no longer sufficient in rapidly evolving areas such as cloud\r\ncomputing, artificial intelligence and enterprise technology. Students must\r\nalso be able to demonstrate that they can apply their knowledge through\r\nlaboratories, projects, practical deployments, problem-solving activities and\r\nprofessional certification. He emphasized that internationally recognized\r\ncertifications can provide students with additional confidence and help\r\ndemonstrate their technical capabilities to employers and industry\r\nprofessionals.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><img src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" data-filename=\"Screenshot 2026-09-21 1316151.jpg\" style=\"width: 582px;\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">The\r\nDirector encouraged the participants to take the training seriously from the\r\nvery beginning and requested them to follow all academic and administrative\r\nguidelines issued during the program. He particularly emphasized regular\r\nattendance, punctuality, discipline, active classroom participation and\r\nconsistent involvement in laboratory work. He advised students not to limit\r\nthemselves to attending lectures or preparing only for examinations, but to use\r\nthe training period as an opportunity to develop real professional competence.\r\nHe also requested the trainees to make maximum use of the facilities available\r\nat KICS and UET Lahore, including technical laboratories, computing resources,\r\nfaculty support, academic guidance and the overall learning environment of the\r\nuniversity. He stressed that students who remain disciplined, practice\r\nconsistently and actively use the available resources will be in a much\r\nstronger position to benefit from the program.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">Prof.\r\nDr. Hafiz Muhammad Shahzad Asif also highlighted the importance of\r\nacademia-industry collaboration in preparing students for current and future\r\ntechnology requirements. He noted that technology is changing rapidly and\r\neducational institutions must continuously connect their teaching and training\r\nactivities with real industry needs. Initiatives such as the Huawei High-Tech\r\nTraining Program provide an important platform where students can learn modern\r\ntechnologies while also gaining exposure to international standards,\r\nprofessional certification systems and practical industry-oriented skills. His\r\nmessage encouraged students to become responsible learners, remain curious, ask\r\nquestions and continuously improve their technical understanding. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">Mr.\r\nKashif Bashir, Senior Manager Trainings, KICS UET Lahore, also welcomed the\r\ntrainees and delivered a motivational message focusing on skills development,\r\nprofessional discipline and career readiness. He highlighted the importance of\r\nusing training opportunities effectively and advised students to approach the\r\nprogram with commitment and a clear professional objective. He explained that\r\nprofessional skills are developed through consistent effort, hands-on practice\r\nand continuous learning, rather than by simply completing a course or receiving\r\na certificate. Students were therefore encouraged to attend classes regularly,\r\ncomplete practical assignments, communicate with instructors and make full use\r\nof the technical facilities provided during the program.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">Mr.\r\nKashif Bashir brings extensive experience in technology training and\r\nskills-development initiatives at UET Lahore. He has been associated with UET\r\nLahore since 2002 and has played an important role in the development of\r\nprofessional technology training programs. He previously served as Manager of\r\nthe Huawei UET Telecom and IT Centre and has been closely associated with\r\nHuawei enterprise training initiatives in Pakistan. His experience also\r\nincludes leadership and coordination of large-scale training programs supported\r\nby national skills-development organizations. Under various NAVTTC and PSDF\r\nskills initiatives implemented at KICS, more than 5,000 trainees have graduated\r\nfrom different technical and vocational programs, providing a strong\r\ninstitutional foundation for the implementation of the current Huawei training\r\nproject. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">During\r\nhis interaction with the students, Mr. Kashif Bashir emphasized that the\r\ntraining environment available at KICS should be treated as an opportunity to\r\nbuild both technical capability and professional behavior. He encouraged\r\ntrainees to develop good habits from the first day, including punctuality,\r\ndiscipline, teamwork, documentation of learning, regular practice and\r\nresponsibility for assigned tasks. He further emphasized that students should\r\nfocus not only on passing certification examinations but also on understanding\r\nhow the technologies covered in the program can be applied in real working\r\nenvironments. His message reinforced the overall objective of the program: to\r\ndevelop skilled professionals who can confidently enter the technology industry\r\nand continue learning as technologies evolve.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">KICS\r\nUET Lahore also acknowledged with appreciation the important support of NAVTTC,\r\nCyberVision and Huawei in making such high-tech training opportunities\r\navailable to Pakistani youth. The National Vocational and Technical Training Commission\r\n(NAVTTC), through the Prime Minister’s Youth Skill Development Program\r\nframework, continues to play an important role in strengthening Pakistan’s\r\ntechnical and vocational education ecosystem and promoting employment-oriented\r\nskills among young people. KICS expressed its gratitude for the continued focus\r\non market-driven, high-tech and internationally aligned training programs that\r\ncan help young professionals prepare for local and international employment\r\nopportunities.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">KICS\r\nalso appreciated CyberVision for its role in the implementation, coordination\r\nand facilitation of the Huawei High-Tech Training Program. Strong coordination\r\nbetween training service providers, technology partners and national\r\nskills-development organizations is essential for the successful delivery of\r\nlarge-scale professional training programs. The contribution of Huawei was also\r\nacknowledged for providing internationally recognized learning and\r\ncertification pathways in modern technology domains. The combined efforts of\r\nNAVTTC, Huawei, CyberVision and KICS UET Lahore provide trainees with an\r\nopportunity to benefit from institutional academic expertise, practical\r\ntechnology training and globally relevant certification standards.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">An\r\nimportant part of the orientation was the introduction of the qualified\r\ninstructional team responsible for delivering the three major training tracks.\r\nMuzzamil Hassan, instructor for HCCDA Tech Essential, was introduced as a\r\nSenior IT Instructor and Curriculum Development Expert with extensive\r\nexperience in training and curriculum development. He has trained more than\r\n1,000 learners and contributed to the development of more than 30 national\r\ncurricula. His areas of expertise include Artificial Intelligence, Cloud\r\nComputing, Python, Cybersecurity and emerging technologies, while he is also\r\npursuing a PhD in Computer Engineering at UET Lahore. His experience in both\r\ncurriculum development and technical training is expected to support students\r\nin developing strong technology fundamentals. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">Shaheryar\r\nFarooq, serving as an instructor for the HCCDA Artificial Intelligence track,\r\nwas introduced as a Lead AI and Systems Engineer and Senior Research Officer.\r\nHis professional areas include Agentic AI, Large Language Models, Natural\r\nLanguage Processing, MLOps, Computer Vision and cloud-native AI systems. His\r\nexperience with technologies such as Kubernetes, Docker, APIs and modern AI\r\narchitectures is expected to provide trainees with exposure to contemporary\r\nArtificial Intelligence practices. Muhammad Ali Sarwar, also associated with\r\nthe HCCDA AI track, is a Senior Research Officer at KICS with an MS in Computer\r\nScience from NUST. His technical background includes applied Artificial\r\nIntelligence, Machine Learning and Computer Vision, with experience in\r\ntechnologies and frameworks such as YOLO, OpenCV, PyTorch and TensorFlow. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">The\r\nHCCDP Solution Architecture track is being delivered by Shahid Zulfiqar and\r\nObaid Malik. Shahid Zulfiqar, Huawei Cloud Trainer and Senior Program Officer\r\nat KICS, previously delivered Huawei HCCDA Tech Essentials training during the\r\nearlier program and brings practical experience with Huawei Cloud technologies\r\nincluding Elastic Cloud Server (ECS), Virtual Private Cloud (VPC), Elastic Load\r\nBalance (ELB), Relational Database Service (RDS), Object Storage Service (OBS)\r\nand Auto Scaling, along with knowledge of Microsoft Azure fundamentals. Obaid\r\nMalik, Senior Research Associate, brings hands-on experience in Huawei Cloud\r\narchitecture and related cloud technologies, along with Azure Fundamentals and\r\nHCIA-AI credentials. Together, the instructors will guide students through the\r\ntechnical and architectural concepts required to understand secure, scalable\r\nand professionally designed cloud solutions.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">The\r\nHCCDP Solution Architecture training has been designed to move students beyond\r\nbasic cloud usage and develop an architecture-oriented mindset. Participants\r\nwill study cloud design methodology, compute solutions, storage architecture,\r\nnetwork design, database solutions, security and compliance, operations and\r\nmaintenance, distributed systems, disaster recovery, high availability,\r\ncontainers, automation and cloud-native technologies. The learning process will\r\nemphasize practical laboratories, architecture discussions, case studies,\r\ndesign decisions and certification preparation. Students will be encouraged to\r\nunderstand why a particular architecture or service is selected rather than\r\nsimply memorizing cloud product names. This approach is intended to prepare\r\nthem for real-world technical environments in which architects and engineers\r\nmust balance performance, security, scalability, reliability and cost. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">To\r\nsupport the academic team and ensure effective program implementation, KICS has\r\nalso assigned a dedicated administrative and support team. The team includes Aqeel\r\nBaber, Senior Manager Admin; Waqas Sardar, Assistant Manager – Mobilization\r\n&amp; Admin; Ms. Shama from Human Resources; and Muhammad Ismaeel, Manager\r\nAccounts. Their involvement will support student coordination, administration,\r\nmobilization, human-resource requirements, financial processes and other\r\noperational matters throughout the training period. This structured\r\nadministrative framework is important for maintaining communication, addressing\r\nstudent requirements and ensuring that academic activities are conducted\r\naccording to the approved program schedule. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">The\r\nformal training period for Batch II is scheduled from 07 September 2026 to 12\r\nDecember 2026. Students will undergo mid-term examinations between 18 October\r\nand 30 October 2026, while the Huawei international certification examination\r\nphase is scheduled from 15 November 2026 to 15 January 2027. Throughout the\r\nprogram, trainees will be expected to maintain attendance, participate actively\r\nin practical sessions, complete assigned learning activities and demonstrate\r\nprofessional conduct. The orientation made it clear that successful completion\r\nof the program will require continuous effort, regular practice and active\r\nparticipation from every trainee. <o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">The\r\nHuawei High-Tech Training Program – Batch II represents another important step\r\nin KICS UET Lahore’s continuing efforts to connect education, professional\r\nskills, international certification and employment opportunities. By bringing\r\ntogether the institutional expertise of KICS UET Lahore, the national\r\nskills-development vision of NAVTTC, the implementation support of CyberVision\r\nand Huawei’s internationally recognized technology ecosystem, the program aims\r\nto create a meaningful pathway for young people to develop capabilities in some\r\nof the most important areas of the modern digital economy. KICS UET Lahore\r\nremains committed to providing a disciplined, practical and industry-oriented\r\nlearning environment and looks forward to supporting the Batch II trainees as\r\nthey progress from classroom learning to professional certification and future\r\ncareer opportunities.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" data-filename=\"photo-collage.png (4).png\" style=\"width: 760px;\"><br></p>', '2026-09-10 01:15:42', '2026-09-21 03:17:26');
INSERT INTO `news` (`id`, `category_id`, `title`, `thumbnail`, `image`, `description`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(33, 1, 'IEEE Lahore Section Mini POCO and Funding Opportunities Workshop Held at UET Lahore', 'new/1790057449_6ab21be96c16e.jpeg', NULL, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 22px; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">The IEEE Lahore Section Mini POCO and Funding Opportunities Workshop was held at the Vice Chancellor’s Conference Room, University of Engineering and Technology (UET) Lahore, bringing together conference organizers, academics, researchers, technical leaders and IEEE volunteers to discuss conference management, funding opportunities, publication standards and best practices for organizing high-quality international conferences.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 22px; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 22px; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">Prof. Dr. Shahzad Asif, Director, Al-Khawarizmi Institute of Computer Science (KICS), UET Lahore, delivered the welcome address and briefed the participants about KICS, its activities, and the objectives of the workshop. He also highlighted that KICS UET Lahore is organizing two major IEEE conferences, <span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">ICOSST and INMIC</span>, at UET Lahore, providing valuable platforms for researchers, academics, and professionals to share knowledge and collaborate. Yasir Saleem Chair IEEE Lahore Section and Associate Professor UET, also welcomed the participants and highlighted the role of IEEE in creating academic, professional and collaborative opportunities for researchers, educators, professionals, students and volunteers.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 22px; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 22px; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">The first technical session, “From Idea to Impact: IEEE Funding Opportunities &amp; Proposal Strategies,” was delivered by Prof. Dr. Muhammad Qasim Mehmood, Chair, IEEE APS/CAS/MTT/SSC Joint Chapter. He discussed various funding and support opportunities available through IEEE and emphasized the importance of developing clear, relevant and purposeful proposals. He highlighted relevance, clarity and passion as key elements for successful engagement with IEEE program and encouraged participants to align proposed activities with the most appropriate IEEE societies and technical communities.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 22px; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 22px; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">The workshop resumed with Prof. Dr. Majid Hussain, Chair, Conference Committee, IEEE Lahore Section and Dean TUF, who delivered a session on “Conference Roles, Responsibilities &amp; IEEE Conference Timeline.” He explained the responsibilities of key conference committees, the importance of clearly defined governance structures and the need for effective coordination throughout the conference lifecycle. He also discussed common mistakes, organizational risks and practical measures for improving conference planning and execution.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21px;\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" data-filename=\"photo-collage.png (8).png\" style=\"width: 760px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 22px; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 22px; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 22px; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">Kashif Bashir, Executive Chair of the 20th International Conference on Open Source Systems and Technologies (ICOSST 2026) and the 28th International Multi-Topic Conference (INMIC 2026) and Senior Manager Trainings KICS-UET, delivered a session on “IEEE Conference Management &amp; Best Practices.” He discussed IEEE conference application and approval procedures, funding pathways, major planning milestones and lessons drawn from international and local IEEE conference initiatives, including IEEE GLOBECOM and ICOSST.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 22px; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 22px; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">Dr. Ghulam Farooque, Associate Professor UOL and TPC Chair, 8th ICACS 2026, delivered a session on the formation and management of Technical Program Committees. He highlighted the importance of assigning clear responsibilities, developing an effective Call for Papers, promoting conferences through multiple channels, managing paper submissions and reviews through platforms such as EasyChair, and ensuring timely completion of technical program activities.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 22px; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 22px; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">Shahid Zulfiqar, KICS-UET and Publication Chair of the 20th ICOSST 2026, delivered a session on “Plagiarism, Paper Quality &amp; Conference Publication Requirements.” He introduced participants to the IEEE Cross Check similarity-checking system and explained its role in maintaining academic integrity and publication quality. The session also covered publication committee responsibilities, similarity review procedures, documentation management and the systematic organization of conference publication records.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 22px; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 22px; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">The program also featured experience-sharing by senior academics and conference leaders, including Prof. Dr. Kaukab Jamal Zuberi, Prof. Dr. Atif Chatha and Prof. Dr. Atif Alvi, who highlighted practical measures for improving conference quality, governance and management. Prof. Dr. Shahzad Sarfraz, Director Campuses, FAST-NUCES, also shared the growth journey of ICIT, highlighting rising paper submissions, expanding international collaboration, institutional partnerships, industry engagement and future plans for stronger research and student development initiatives.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 22px; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 22px; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">Two Memoranda of Understanding were signed during the workshop: one between IEEE Communications Society Lahore Chapter Chair Mr. Kashif Bashir and the University of Lahore Dean Prof. Dr. Atif Chatha for an upcoming AI Summit, and another between IEEE Lahore Section and FAST-NUCES Faisalabad Campus to strengthen collaboration for the ICIT conference, followed by the presentation of shields, certificates and souvenirs to speakers, organizers, distinguished guests and participants. Closing remarks were followed by lunch and networking.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 22px; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 22px; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">The workshop provided a professional platform for knowledge exchange and strengthened participants’ understanding of IEEE funding mechanisms, conference governance, technical program management, publication quality and organizational best practices. It also reinforced the role of IEEE conferences in promoting research, professional development, collaboration and technological innovation.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 22px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">The IEEE Lahore Section Mini POCO 2026 witnessed strong participation from academia, industry and the IEEE volunteer community, with representatives from the University of Engineering and Technology (UET) Lahore and its campuses, University of the Punjab/PUCIT, Information Technology University (ITU),The University of Lahore (UOL), University of Management and Technology (UMT), University of Central Punjab (UCP), Bahria University, Lahore Garrison University, Kinnaird College for Women, FAST-NUCES, Riphah International University,&nbsp; National College of Business Administration &amp; Economics, and Grand Asian University Sialkot. The event also attracted professionals from organizations including NTDC, Asia Insurance Company Limited and the software industry, along with IEEE Section, Chapter, Student Branch and other volunteer representatives.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; text-align: justify; line-height: 21px;\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" data-filename=\"photo-collage.png (9).png\" style=\"width: 760px;\"></p>', '2026-09-22 01:10:49', '2026-09-22 01:10:49');
INSERT INTO `news` (`id`, `category_id`, `title`, `thumbnail`, `image`, `description`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(34, 1, 'Admissions Open for PMYSDP Summer of Code – Batch III', 'new/1790593827_6aba4b2380abb.jpg', NULL, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\">\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n        Al-Khawarizmi Institute of Computer Science (KICS), University of Engineering and Technology (UET) Lahore, is accepting applications for <b>PMYSDP Summer of Code Batch III</b>, a <b>NAVTTC-sponsored skills training program</b> designed to equip participants with practical, industry-relevant technical skills.\r\n        <o:p></o:p>\r\n    </span>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\">\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n        The training is <b>100% FREE for selected candidates</b>. Applicants interested in joining the program are required to complete the online application form and subsequently submit the required documents in hard copy at KICS, UET Lahore.\r\n        <o:p></o:p>\r\n    </span>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Verdana,sans-serif !important;font-size:22px !important;font-weight:700 !important;line-height:1.3 !important;text-align:left !important;margin:15px 0 10px 0 !important;\">\r\n    Offered Training Programs\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\">\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n        Training opportunities are available in high-demand technology and industrial domains, including <b>Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning &amp; Deep Learning, Advanced Web Development, Advanced Python Programming, JavaScript Full Stack Development, Cloud Computing, AWS Cloud, Cyber Security &amp; Digital Forensics, Network Administration, Digital Marketing &amp; SEO, Graphic Designing, Industrial Automation / PLC, Renewable Energy / Solar Technology</b>, and other approved technology-focused trades offered under the program.\r\n        <o:p></o:p>\r\n    </span>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Verdana,sans-serif !important;font-size:22px !important;font-weight:700 !important;line-height:1.3 !important;text-align:left !important;margin:15px 0 10px 0 !important;\">\r\n    How to Apply\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\">\r\n    <b>\r\n        <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n            Step 1 – Fill the Online Application Form\r\n        </span>\r\n    </b>\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n        <o:p></o:p>\r\n    </span>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\">\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n        Every candidate must complete the online admission form in order to be considered for the <b>interview and admission process</b>.\r\n        <o:p></o:p>\r\n    </span>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:150%\">\r\n    <b>\r\n        <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n            Apply Online:\r\n        </span>\r\n    </b>\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\"><br></span>\r\n\r\n    <b>\r\n        <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,sans-serif;\">\r\n            👉\r\n        </span>\r\n\r\n        <a href=\"https://bit.ly/navttcsoc3\" style=\"color:#0000EE !important;text-decoration:underline !important;\">\r\n            <span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif;\">\r\n                https://bit.ly/navttcsoc3\r\n            </span>\r\n        </a>\r\n    </b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\">\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n        Please fill in the application form <b>carefully and accurately</b>. The information submitted through this form may be used during the verification and interview process. Providing incorrect, incomplete, or misleading information may result in <b>cancellation of the application/admission</b>.\r\n        <o:p></o:p>\r\n    </span>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\">\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n        Completion of the online form is mandatory for candidates who wish to appear in the interview.\r\n        <o:p></o:p>\r\n    </span>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\">\r\n    <b>\r\n        <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n            Step 2 – Submit Hard Copy at KICS, UET Lahore\r\n            <o:p></o:p>\r\n        </span>\r\n    </b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\">\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n        After completing the online application form, candidates are required to <b>visit the KICS campus and submit the hard copy of their admission form along with the required supporting documents</b>.\r\n        <o:p></o:p>\r\n    </span>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\">\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n        Hard-copy applications can be submitted:\r\n        <o:p></o:p>\r\n    </span>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:150%\">\r\n    <b>\r\n        <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n            Monday to Friday\r\n        </span>\r\n    </b>\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n        <br>\r\n        <b>10:00 AM to 4:00 PM</b>\r\n        <o:p></o:p>\r\n    </span>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:150%\">\r\n    <b>\r\n        <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n            Submission Venue:\r\n        </span>\r\n    </b>\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n        <br>\r\n        Al-Khawarizmi Institute of Computer Science (KICS)<br>\r\n        University of Engineering and Technology (UET), Lahore\r\n        <o:p></o:p>\r\n    </span>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:150%\">\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n        <b>Google Map Link:</b>\r\n    </span>\r\n\r\n    <a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/aifumJqbrNXSPtCt7\" style=\"color:#0000EE !important;text-decoration:underline !important;\">\r\n        <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n            <b>https://maps.app.goo.gl/aifumJqbrNXSPtCt7</b>\r\n        </span>\r\n    </a>\r\n\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n        <o:p></o:p>\r\n    </span>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Verdana,sans-serif !important;font-size:22px !important;font-weight:700 !important;line-height:1.3 !important;text-align:left !important;margin:15px 0 10px 0 !important;\">\r\n    Documents Required\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\">\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n        Candidates should bring the following documents along with the printed/hard copy of the admission form:\r\n        <o:p></o:p>\r\n    </span>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top:0cm\" type=\"disc\">\r\n    <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%;\">\r\n        <b>\r\n            <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n                One recent photograph\r\n            </span>\r\n        </b>\r\n        <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span>\r\n    </li>\r\n\r\n    <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%;\">\r\n        <b>\r\n            <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n                Copy of CNIC\r\n            </span>\r\n        </b>\r\n        <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span>\r\n    </li>\r\n\r\n    <li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%;\">\r\n        <b>\r\n            <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n                Copies of academic degrees/certificates\r\n            </span>\r\n        </b>\r\n        <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\"><o:p></o:p></span>\r\n    </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\">\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n        Candidates are advised to ensure that their application and supporting documents are complete before submission.\r\n        <o:p></o:p>\r\n    </span>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Verdana,sans-serif !important;font-size:22px !important;font-weight:700 !important;line-height:1.3 !important;text-align:left !important;margin:15px 0 10px 0 !important;\">\r\n    Course Duration\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\">\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n        The training courses are of approximately <b>3 months duration</b>, followed by an additional <b>3-week internship</b>.\r\n        <o:p></o:p>\r\n    </span>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\">\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n        The program is intended to provide participants with both technical training and practical exposure relevant to their selected field.\r\n        <o:p></o:p>\r\n    </span>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Verdana,sans-serif !important;font-size:22px !important;font-weight:700 !important;line-height:1.3 !important;text-align:left !important;margin:15px 0 10px 0 !important;\">\r\n    Important Instructions for Applicants\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\">\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n        Candidates should regularly check the KICS website for <b>interview schedules, shortlisted candidates, class commencement dates, document requirements, admission updates, and other important announcements</b>.\r\n        <o:p></o:p>\r\n    </span>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\">\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n        Please note that submission of the online application form or hard-copy documents <b>does not by itself confirm admission</b>. Candidates are required to complete the prescribed admission and interview process.\r\n        <o:p></o:p>\r\n    </span>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\">\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n        Applicants should therefore provide an <b>active mobile/WhatsApp number</b> in the admission form and keep checking official KICS communication channels for updates.\r\n        <o:p></o:p>\r\n    </span>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Verdana,sans-serif !important;font-size:22px !important;font-weight:700 !important;line-height:1.3 !important;text-align:left !important;margin:15px 0 10px 0 !important;\">\r\n    Keep Visiting KICS Website for Updates\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\">\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n        For the latest information regarding <b>admissions, interviews, selected candidates, schedules, classes, and other announcements</b>, keep visiting:\r\n        <o:p></o:p>\r\n    </span>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\">\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,sans-serif;\">🌐</span>\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\"> </span>\r\n\r\n    <a href=\"http://kics.edu.pk/\" style=\"color:#0000EE !important;text-decoration:underline !important;\">\r\n        <b>\r\n            <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n                www.kics.edu.pk\r\n            </span>\r\n        </b>\r\n    </a>\r\n\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n        <o:p></o:p>\r\n    </span>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;line-height:150%\">\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n        Candidates are strongly encouraged to rely on the <b>KICS website and official contact numbers</b> for updated information.\r\n        <o:p></o:p>\r\n    </span>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Verdana,sans-serif !important;font-size:22px !important;font-weight:700 !important;line-height:1.3 !important;text-align:left !important;margin:15px 0 10px 0 !important;\">\r\n    For Queries &amp; Admission Assistance\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:150%\">\r\n    <b>\r\n        <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n            Waqas Sardar\r\n        </span>\r\n    </b>\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n        <br>\r\n    </span>\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,sans-serif\">📞</span>\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n        0332-4232521\r\n        <o:p></o:p>\r\n    </span>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:150%\">\r\n    <b>\r\n        <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n            Shahid – WhatsApp Only\r\n        </span>\r\n    </b>\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n        <br>\r\n    </span>\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,sans-serif\">📱</span>\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n        0300-6804657\r\n        <o:p></o:p>\r\n    </span>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:150%\">\r\n    <b>\r\n        <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n            Umair Waheed – Industrial Automation / Solar\r\n        </span>\r\n    </b>\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n        <br>\r\n    </span>\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,sans-serif\">📞</span>\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n        +92-343-4335844\r\n        <o:p></o:p>\r\n    </span>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:150%\">\r\n    <b>\r\n        <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n            KICS Training Office\r\n        </span>\r\n    </b>\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n        <br>\r\n    </span>\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,sans-serif\">☎️</span>\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n        042-99250262\r\n        <o:p></o:p>\r\n    </span>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"font-family:Verdana,sans-serif !important;font-size:22px !important;font-weight:700 !important;line-height:1.3 !important;text-align:left !important;margin:15px 0 10px 0 !important;\">\r\n    Apply Now\r\n</h2>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:150%\">\r\n    <b>\r\n        <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n            PMYSDP Summer of Code Batch III\r\n        </span>\r\n    </b>\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n        <br>\r\n        <b>NAVTTC Sponsored | Free Skills Training | KICS, UET Lahore</b>\r\n        <o:p></o:p>\r\n    </span>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:150%\">\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,sans-serif;\">👉</span>\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n        <b>Online Application Form:</b>\r\n        <br>\r\n    </span>\r\n\r\n    <a href=\"https://bit.ly/navttcsoc3\" style=\"color:#0000EE !important;text-decoration:underline !important;\">\r\n        <b>\r\n            <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n                https://bit.ly/navttcsoc3\r\n            </span>\r\n        </b>\r\n    </a>\r\n\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n        <o:p></o:p>\r\n    </span>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:150%\">\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,sans-serif;\">🌐</span>\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n        <b>Latest Updates:</b>\r\n        <br>\r\n    </span>\r\n\r\n    <a href=\"http://kics.edu.pk/\" style=\"color:#0000EE !important;text-decoration:underline !important;\">\r\n        <b>\r\n            <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n                www.kics.edu.pk\r\n            </span>\r\n        </b>\r\n    </a>\r\n\r\n    <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Verdana&quot;,sans-serif\">\r\n        <o:p></o:p>\r\n    </span>\r\n</p>', '2026-09-28 06:10:27', '2026-09-28 08:03:33');
