(132, 'Mr.Fahmeed_Akram', 132, 131, 6, 17, 'Mr.', 'Fahmeed', 'Akram', '', 'fahmeed.akram@kics.edu.pk', '042-99250228', '', '03108038396', '', 'FahmeedAkram1188', 0, '<p>Mr. Fahmeed completed his MS (Telecommunication System) from UCP Lahore and graduted in computer science from COMSATS Lahore. He is HCNA (Routing Swtiching, Video Conferencing), HCNP (Routing Switching) and HCIE (Routing Switching) written ceritfied. As a Huawei Certified Instructor, &nbsp;multiple studetns and Huawei channel partners are trainied by him. His next plan to appear in HCIE Lab and prepare himself to deliever 1st Huawei Cloude Computing training in Pakistan. &nbsp;</p>', '<p>fahmeed.akram@kics.edu.pk</p>', 1, 9),
