(181, 'Amir', 181, 130, 7, 41, 'Dr.', 'Amir', 'Mehmood', '', 'amir.mehmood', '', '', '', '+92-42-9250246', 'AmirMehmood1629', 0, '<p>Dr Amir Mehmood is currently working as Associate Professor and the Director of High Performance Computing and Networking Lab (HPCNL), at Al-Khawarizmi Institute of Computer Science, University of Engineering and Technology, Lahore, Pakistan. <span style=\"color: #222222; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Amir Mehmood is a subject matter expert in distributed systems, data science, artificial intelligence, social computing, systems engineering, and telecommunication with diverse experience in both industry and academia.</span>&nbsp;</span>He has&nbsp;obtained his Ph.D. degree in Engineering from the department of Electrical Engineering and Computer Science, Technical University Berlin / Deutsche Telekom Innovation Laboratories, Berlin, Germany in 2012. He has done an internship at the Institute of Pure and Applied Mathematics (IPAM), University of California Los Angeles, USA.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>website:<span style=\"color: #0000ff;\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://amir-mehmood.github.io/\"><span style=\"color: #0000ff;\">https://amir-mehmood.github.io/</span></a></span></p>', '<ul>\r\n<li>Distributed Systems</li>\r\n<li>Artificial Intelligence</li>\r\n<li>Social Computing</li>\r\n<li>Health Informatics</li>\r\n<li>Cyber Security</li>\r\n<li>Network Performance Evaluation&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Teaching</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Operating System Concepts, Computer Networks, Big Data Analytics, RouterLab Praktikum, Advance and Next Generation Computer Networks, Multimedia Applications over Broadband Networks, Advance Computer Networks, Current and Next Generation Networks.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<div><strong>Research projects</strong>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>National Center in big data and Cloud Computing (HEC, Ministry of planning and development, Pakistan (2018-2023)</li>\r\n<li>Urdu Search Engine - Humkinar Pakistan (ICT RDF, 2012-present, PKR 33.3 M)&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Run time parallelization of sequential binary code through JVM ( HEC 2015-present, PKR 3.4 M)</li>\r\n<li>Development of Type2 hypervisor for MIPS64 based systems (ICT RDF, 2013-15, PKR 15.25 M)</li>\r\n<li>System Mode Emulation in QEMU (HEC, 2013-15, PKR 4.05 M)</li>\r\n<li>Mobisense/Mobisense Video (T-Labs, Berlin Germany, 2007-12)</li>\r\n<li>Benchmarking ATM backbone of Pakistan Internet Exchange in collaboration with LUMS (PTCL R&amp;D Fund, 2005)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Professional activities</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Reviewer for Journals IEEE Network, Elsevier Computer Communications, Springer Computing</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Awards</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Best paper at IEEE ICET Conference, 2005, Islamabad Pakistan.</li>\r\n<li>Best paper at IEEE CQR Workshop, 2011, Florida USA.</li>\r\n<li>First prize in 2nd IEEE annual final year project competition at University of Engineering and Technology, Lahore Pakistan, 1996.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 0, 3),
(182, 'usmanghani_khan', 182, 13, 3, 13, 'Dr.', 'M. Usman', 'Ghani Khan', '', 'usman.ghani', '92 9029450', '829', '', '', 'M. UsmanGhani Khan1638', 0, '<p>Dr. Muhammad Usman Ghani is an Associate Professor in the Department of Computer Science, University of Engineering and Technology, Lahore. His PhD (from Sheffield University, Uk) study was concerned with statistical modelling for machine vision signals, specifically language descriptions of video steams. He has been studying on spoken language processing using statistical approaches with applications such as information extraction from speech and speech summarisation. His recent work is concerned with multimedia, incorporating text, audio and visual processing into one frame work.</p>', '<ul style=\"padding: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 10px 25px; color: #333333; font-family: \'Lucida Grande\', \'Lucida Sans Unicode\', Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">\r\n<li>Natural Language Processing</li>\r\n<li>Computer Vision</li>\r\n<li>Image Processing, Computer Graphics, Augmented Reality</li>\r\n<li>Audio, Speech Processing, Recognition and Perception</li>\r\n<li>Cloud Computing - Software Design and Security Perspectivs</li>\r\n<li>Machine learning for Bioinformatics Data</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div id=\"__zsc_once\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div id=\"__if72ru4sdfsdfruh7fewui_once\" style=\"display: none;\">&nbsp;</div>', 0, 6),
(183, 'Mr.KashifBashir', 183, 16, 6, 105, 'Mr.', 'Kashif', 'Bashir', '', 'kashif@kics.edu.pk', '+924299250262', '', '+923234480000', '', 'KashifBashir1647jpg', 0, '<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Mr. Kashif Bashir is the Chair of the IEEE Communication Society and Vice-chair of the IEEE Lahore Section. He is working at UET Lahore Since 2002. He organized the first Seminar on Punjab IT Policy and Action Plan in 2006. He served as Manager of Huawei UET Telecom and IT Centre from 2007 to 2014. More than 7000 certificates of telecom training were distributed to the students of Pakistan. He is also the founder of Huawei enterprise training in Pakistan. From 2015 he is working as Manager Trainings in KICS-UET Lahore. He is the founder of the IEEE COMSOC Summer School in region-10. and organized 4 Summer Schools.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: black; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">He is also founder of AI summit in Information and communication in Pakistan.</span><span style=\"color: black;\">He has also been part of organizing bodies of many well-reputed international Conferences Such as ICOSST, ICECE, ICIC, INMIC, ETECTE, ICEPE and ICEEST</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: black; mso-ansi-language: EN-GB;\" lang=\"EN-GB\">International Publication</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 32.2pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span class=\"MsoHyperlink\"><span style=\"font-family: Roboto; mso-fareast-font-family: Roboto; mso-bidi-font-family: Roboto; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1-<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span class=\"MsoHyperlink\"><a href=\"https://gcn.comsoc.org/first-ieee-comsoc-summer-school-program-pakistan\"><span style=\"font-family: Roboto;\">https://gcn.comsoc.org/first-ieee-comsoc-summer-school-program-pakistan</span></a></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 32.2pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Roboto; mso-fareast-font-family: Roboto; mso-bidi-font-family: Roboto; color: blue;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">2-<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Roboto; color: black;\"><a href=\"https://gcn.comsoc.org/asia-pacific-ieee-comsoc-summer-school-2017-lahore-pakistan\">https://gcn.comsoc.org/asia-pacific-ieee-comsoc-summer-school-2017-lahore-pakistan</a></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 32.2pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span class=\"MsoHyperlink\"><span style=\"font-family: Roboto; mso-fareast-font-family: Roboto; mso-bidi-font-family: Roboto; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">3-<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span class=\"MsoHyperlink\"><span style=\"font-family: Roboto;\"><a href=\"https://gcn.comsoc.org/ieee-comsoc-summer-school-2018-intelligent-communication-networks-lahore-pakistan\">https://gcn.comsoc.org/ieee-comsoc-summer-school-2018-intelligent-communication-networks-lahore-pakistan</a></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 32.2pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span class=\"MsoHyperlink\"><span style=\"font-family: Roboto; mso-fareast-font-family: Roboto; mso-bidi-font-family: Roboto; text-decoration: none; text-underline: none;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">4-<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span class=\"MsoHyperlink\"><span style=\"font-family: Roboto;\