(292, 'atiq', 291, 133, 16, 53, 'Mr.', 'Atiq', 'Ur Rehman', '', 'atiq.rehman@kics.edu.pk', '', '', '03337732136', '', 'AtiqUr Rehman2628', 0, '<p><span style=\"color: #444444; font-family: \'Helvetica Neue\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18.5714282989502px; text-align: justify;\">Atiq Ur Rehman&nbsp;is a Research Officer at KICS, an institute of the University of Engineering and Technology (UET), Lahore. He holds MS degree in&nbsp;Electrical Engineering from UET Lahore and BS degree in Electrical (Telecom) Engineering&nbsp;from COMSATS Institute of Information Technology, Lahore. His current research interests are in Internet of Things, cognitive radios, multimedia communication, wireless networks and networks security.</span></p>', '', 1, 0),
(293, 'm.farooq', 292, 134, 4, 56, 'Mr.', 'Muhammad', 'Farooq', '', 'muhammad.farooq@kics.edu.pk', '', '', '', '', 'malePic.jpg', 0, '', '', 1, 0),
(294, 'zeenat_afzal', 293, 134, 7, 56, 'Ms.', 'Zeenat', 'Afzal', '', 'zeenat.afzal@kics.edu.pk', '', '', '', '', 'malePic.jpg', 0, '', '', 1, 0),
(296, 'sidra.hanif', 296, 134, 12, 56, 'Ms.', 'Sidra', 'Hanif', '', 'sidra.hanif@kics.edu.pk', '', '', '', '', 'SidraHanif2664', 0, '', '', 1, 0),
(297, 'farhan.riaz', 299, 16, 15, 112, 'Mr.', 'Farhan', 'Riaz', '', 'farhan.riaz', '', '', '', '', 'FarhanRiaz2673jpg', 40, '<p>Following his graduation in Mechatronics &amp; Control Engineering, M.Farhan Riaz is practicing and a result-driven entrepreneur having more than 10 years of experience in the field of startups. He joined KICS, University of Engineering &amp; Technology (UET Lahore) in 2014 and then founded the Technology Incubation &amp; Commercialization Center of the university.</p>\r\n<p>Before joining UET, he bootstrapped his chatting client which happened to be Pakistan&rsquo;s first ever Mobile Messenger back then with a big user base across the globe. It taught him well about startup dynamics. By the virtue of it, he consults, mentors and coaches startups. He also used to teach Entrepreneurship Specialization courses in the University of Central Punjab from 2011-2014 where he co-founded the Department of Entrepreneurship with Dr. Shehryar.</p>\r\n<p>Recognized by GCIP UNIDO as the best mentor for Cleantech Business Plan Competition in Silicon Valley, he specializes and is interested in the following areas ;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Innovation &amp; Entrepreneurial Ecosystems</li>\r\n<li>Business Incubation &amp; Research Commercialization</li>\r\n<li>Business Systemization &amp; Scaling Early Stage Startups,</li>\r\n<li>Idea Generation &amp; Creativity</li>\r\n<li>Guerrilla Marketing &amp; Growth Hacking,</li>\r\n<li>Digital Marketing &amp; E-commerce</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Analytical with strong systems skills, his method of coaching is experiential and has even gamified some of his classes. He also mentors startups in other universities and incubators and is now focused on creating an entrepreneurial ecosystem in the university to foster innovation and startup culture.</p>', '', 0, 0),
(298, 'safeer.ullah', 301, 15, 1, 62, 'Mr.', 'Safeer Ullah', 'Siddiqui', '', 'Safeer@kics.edu.pk', '', '850', '', '', '3004-Safeer Ullah.jpg', 0, '', '', 1, 0),
(299, 'dawer.saeed', 302, 133, 3, 53, 'Mr.', 'Dawer', 'Saeed', '', 'dawer.saeed@kics.edu.pk', '+92 42 99029450', '802', '03218868747', '', 'DawerSaeed2691jpg', 10, '<p><strong style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">Dawer Saeed </span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">was born in Lahore, Pakistan.</span><strong style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt;\">&nbsp;Dawer started his early schooling from KAPCO Secondary School, KAPCO, Kot Adu and after he moved to Lahore in 2002 he completed his Secondary education from board of Intermediate and Secondary education Lahore in 2005. After completing his Secondary education he completed his intermediate from Govt. Islamia College Civil Lines, Lahore in 2008. He completed his Bachelors in Mechatronics and Control Engineering from University of Engineering &amp; Technology, Lahore in 2012. During his graduation he successfully completed several projects based on Electronics, Robotics. He has also served as Vice President Technical for department based student\'s society \"Mechatronics Club\". After completing his bachelors he started working for Khawaja Electronics Pvt. Limited as Production Engineer where he has been involved in the research and development of Electrolytic capacitors and worked on their performance enhancement using a low cost Aluminium Foil. He has also Contributed well in streamlining the production flow by introducing different techniques which eventually resulted in the increase of daily production. Then after switching and serving for one year to Pakistan Cycle Industrial Co-operative society as Assistant Manager Production, he joined Al-Khwarizmi Institute of Computer Sciences,</span><span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt;\">&nbsp;University of Engineering and Technology, Lahore Pakistan since August, 2014. He has worked on different projects majorly on Near Field Communication and WiFi. He has also written different papers. He has also presented his paper at International Conference on Open Source Systems and Technologies (ICOSST) held at UET Lahore on 17-20</span><sup style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif;\">th</sup><span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt;\">&nbsp;December, 2014. Alongwith his research and professional activities, Dawer also has his interests in different social and community services activities, he has been a mentor with \"The Citizen Foundation\" schools. Where he has mentored and motivated school children of village area to how to pursue their career and excel in it even if you do not have your family conditions in your favour.</span></p>', '<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\">Dawer has been doing research in different fields of technology, he has done research on NFC which stands for Near Field Communication and he has also done some research based on IoT based project, like he has published a research paper on \"design of ANPR System utilizing short range wireless technologies\"&nbsp;</span></p>', 1, 0),
(300, 'jawad_ullah', 303, 134, 2, 55, 'Mr.', 'Jawad', 'Ullah', '', 'jawadullah@kics.edu.pk', '+92 42 99029450', '', '03008448773', '', 'JawadUllah2700', 0, '<p>Jawad Ullah</p>', '', 1, 0),
(301, 'atiq.saber', 304, 134, 2, 54, 'Mr.', 'Atiq', 'Saber', '', 'atiq.saber', '+92-42-99029450', '828', '03237033609', '', 'AtiqSaber2709', 0, '<p><span style=\"line-height: 115%;\">Atique Saber is currently working as a Web Developer at KICS, an institute of the University of Engineering and Technology (UET), Lahore.</span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"> He joined Al-Khawarizmi Institute of Computer Science (KICS) in 2014 as Web Developer in the Embedded Systems &amp; Enterprise Software Solutions Lab (ESESS).</span></p>\r\n<div id=\"index_p\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" title=\"biography\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><strong>Specialties: Databases, J2EE, Codeigniter, Javascript, Team management</strong><br /></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\">Education : M.Sc I.T</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small;\"><br /></span></p>', '<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: comic sans ms,sans-serif; font-size: small;\">Programming Languages</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: comic sans ms,sans-serif; font-size: small;\">Web Technologies</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: comic sans ms,sans-serif; font-size: small;\">Software Design &amp; Architecture</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: comic sans ms,sans-serif; font-size: small;\">Enterprise Management Systems</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: comic sans ms,sans-serif; font-size: small;\">Frontend Technologies</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: comic sans ms,sans-serif; font-size: small;\">ERP Systems</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', 0, 0),
(302, 'aatka_ali', 305, 134, 2, 56, 'Ms.', 'Aatka', 'Ali', '', 'aatka.ali@kics.edu.pk', '', '', '', '', 'AatkaAli2718', 1, '<p><span style=\"font-family: times new roman,times;\">Aatka Ali received her Bachelor degree in Computer Engineering from Bahauddin Zakariya University(BZU), Multan in 2009. She has received her MS/M.Phil degree in Computer Science from UET Lahore in 2015. She has joined KICS as a Research Officer and currently working at Embedded Systems &amp; Enterprise Software Solutions Lab. Currently she is working on Invoice Processing Automation System (I.P.A.S) project</span></p>', '<ul style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\r\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\">Software Engineering</li>\r\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\">Artificial Intelligence</li>\r\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\">Programming Languages</li>\r\n</ul>', 1, 0),
