(680, 'wasifali', 688, 134, 0, 0, 'Mr.', 'Wasif', 'Ali', '', 'wasif.ali@kics.edu.pk', '0332-8693303', '', '', '', 'WasifAli6120jpg', 0, '', '', 1, 0),
(681, 'MuhammadBilal', 689, 134, 0, 54, 'Mr.', 'Muhammad ', 'Bilal', '', 'muhammad.bilal', '', '', '+92-300-2022247', '', 'Muhammad Bilal6129jpg', 0, '<p>Muhammad Bilal has been working as a Research Officer at Human-Centered Robotics Lab, Al-Khawarizmi Institute of Computer Science, University of Engineering and Technology (UET), Lahore, Pakistan, since 2019. He has completed M.Sc. in Mechatronics Engineering from UET, Lahore, Pakistan. He worked as Graduate Assistant at the Mechatronics department, UET, Lahore for six months.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Qualification:</strong></p>\r\n<p>M.Sc. Mechatronics Engineering | University of Engineering and Technology, Lahore</p>\r\n<p>B.Sc. Mechatronics and Control Engineering | University of Engineering and Technology, Lahore</p>', '<p>Human-Robot Interaction</p>\r\n<p>Robot Calligraphy</p>\r\n<p>Force Control</p>', 0, 0),
(682, 'Wasif Ali', 690, 134, 0, 54, 'Mr.', 'Wasif ', 'Ali', '', 'wasif.ali@kics.edu.pk', '', '', '0332-8693303', '', '8653-Wasif Ali.jpg', 0, '<p>Engr. Wasif Ali has been working as a Research Officer/Engineer at &ldquo;Human Centric Robotics (HCR) Lab&rdquo; since its inception 9 months back. He is primarily working in the domain of design a &ldquo;Mechatronic Research Simulator for CPR &ndash; a pilot study&rdquo;</p>\r\n<p>Before joining the HCR Lab, he was working as an MCAD Engineer in a Mechatronic product design field and successfully carried out various projects. Before this, he was working as a Lab Engineer in the Mechanical Technology Department in a private university.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Qualification:</strong></p>\r\n<p>M.Sc. Mechatronics Engineering (UET Lahore)</p>', '<p>Biomedical Engineering</p>\r\n<p>Mechatronic Product Designing and Development</p>\r\n<p>Soft Robotics</p>\r\n<p>Control System</p>', 1, 0),
(713, 'sharafsultan', 693, 134, 0, 54, 'Mr.', 'Muhammad Sharaf', 'Sultan', '', 'sharaf.sultan@kics.edu.pk', '', '', '', '', 'Muhammad SharafSultan6417jpg', 0, '', '', 1, 0),
