(784, 'muhammadali', 772, 134, 0, 134, 'Mr.', 'Muhammad ', 'Ali', '', 'mali@kics.edu.pk', '', '', '', '', '3409-Muhammad Ali.jpg', 0, '<p>Muhammad Ali has been working as an Instructor in the Human-Centered Robotics Lab since 2020 where he is teaching Mechatronics (Robotics) High-end course under NAVTTC&rsquo;s Kamyab Jawan Program. Previously, he worked in Al-Badar Engineering Co. in the Maintenance Department.</p>\r\n<p>Qualification:</p>\r\n<p>M.Sc. Mechatronics Engineering | University of Engineering and Technology, Lahore</p>\r\n<p>B.Sc. Mechatronics Engineering | Air University, Islamabad</p>', '<p>Rehabilitation</p>\r\n<p>Force Control</p>\r\n<p>Industrial Automation</p>\r\n<p>Embedded Systems</p>', 1, 0),
(785, 'talhabashir', 773, 134, 0, 54, 'Mr.', 'Talha ', 'Bashir', '', 'talha.bashir@kics.edu.pk', '', '', '', '', '5483-Talha Bashir.png', 0, '<p>Talha Bashir is an industrious, hardworking, and innovative engineer. He has been working as an Instructor at the Human-Centered Robotics Lab where he is teaching diploma holder students under Kamyab Jawan Program.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Qualification:</strong></p>\r\n<p>B.Sc. Mechatronics and Control Engineering</p>', '<p>Collaborative Robots</p>\r\n<p>Algorithm development</p>\r\n<p>Prosthetics</p>', 1, 0),
(786, 'nidasiddique', 774, 134, 0, 134, 'Ms.', 'Nida ', 'Siddique', '', 'nida.siddique@kics.edu.pk', '', '', '', '', 'malePic.jpg', 0, '', '', 1, 0),
(787, 'mohsin.rizwan', 777, 13, 0, 137, 'Dr.', 'Mohsin', 'Rizwan', '', 'mohsin.rizwan', '', '', '', '', '9602-Picture - Dr Mohsin Rizwan.jpg', 0, '<p>Dr. Mohsin Rizwan has diverse teaching, research, and industry in the areas of system modeling, micro-electromechanical systems, structural design, dynamic analysis, and control. His primary research interests involve mathematical modeling and control development for human-centered applications. He is Co-PI of the Human-Centered Robotics Lab of the NCRA with a focus on the development of active/passive exoskeletons for industrial &amp; biomedical applications.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>', '<p>Structural design and static/dynamic analysis</p>\r\n<p>System-level mathematical modeling and response analysis of mechanical/electromechanical systems</p>\r\n<p>Development of Model-based control and optimization</p>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>', 0, 0),
(788, 'mahsan', 778, 13, 0, 137, 'Dr.', 'Muhammad ', 'Ahsan', '', 'm.ahsan', '', '', '', '', '4099-Picture - Dr Muhammad Ahsan.jpg', 0, '<p>Dr. Muhammad Ahsan has expertise in fault-tolerant quantum computer architecture design and analysis. His major contribution is an open-source quantum computer resource-performance simulation tool called sQrIpT, which was developed under the IARPA Quantum Computer Science program. The tool has been frequently cited, utilized, and upgraded by the quantum CAD community for the optimal layout of large quantum circuits. He is also a member of the IBM quantum computing researchers program which offers access to IBM advance superconducting quantum chips for research experimentation. Recently, he has been branching out into other inter-disciplinary areas including robotics and artificial intelligence</p>', '<p>Computer-aided design and modeling</p>\r\n<p>Simulation of a complex dynamical system</p>\r\n<p>Development of collaborative manipulator</p>', 0, 0),
(789, 'hafizfarhanmaqbool', 779, 13, 0, 137, 'Dr.', 'Hafiz Farhan', 'Maqbool', '', 'farhan.maqbool', '', '', '', '', '2493-Picture - Dr Farhan Maqbool.png', 0, '<p>Dr. Maqbool has diverse teaching and research experience. His primary research interests include biomechatronics, lower limb biomechanics, machine learning, and robotics. He is working as a Co-PI at the Human-Centered Robotics Lab of the NCRA for the development of lower limb active/semi-active prostheses and multi-sensor, multi-channel data acquisition system. His current focus is to develop intelligent devices (artificial limbs, exoskeleton) to support and enhance human mobility.</p>', '<p>Lower Limb Prostheses Development</p>\r\n<p>Biomechanical Sensing System</p>', 0, 0),
(790, 'mzeeshan', 780, 134, 0, 54, 'Mr.', 'Muhammad ', 'Zeeshan', '', 'muhammad.zeeshan', '', '847', '', '', '460-Muhammad Zeeshan.jpg', 0, '', '', 0, 0),
