(801, 'farooqali', 794, 133, 0, 130, 'Mr.', 'Farooq', 'Ali', '', 'farooq.ali', '', '867', '0323-4265791', '', 'FarooqAli7209jpg', 0, '<p><span id=\"docs-internal-guid-f22598db-7fff-7249-6d3d-82bd480ddbd2\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #222222; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Farooq Ali is Business Development Officer at IoT Research and Innovation Lab. His Overall business development experience is 3+ years and has worked on different brands. His approach is to build a brand from scratch. He has hands-on market experience in the local and international markets. He received his BS in Computer Science Degree from the University of Central Punjab, Lahore. He is well aware of his target market. </span></span></p>', '', 1, 0),
