(811, 'sabeeha.tanveer', 810, 133, 0, 53, 'Ms.', 'Sabeeha ', 'Tanweer', '', 'sabeeha.tanveer', '', '867', '', '', 'Sabeeha Tanweer7299jpg', 0, '<p style=\"line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background-color: #ffffff; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Sabeeha Tanveer received her B.S. degree in Computer Science from the University of Lahore (UOL), Lahore, Pakistan in 2018 and an M.S. degree in Computer Science from the National University of Computer and Emerging Sciences (NUCES-FAST), Lahore, Pakistan in 2020.</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.38; text-align: justify; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial; color: #222222; background-color: #ffffff; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Currently, she is working as a Senior Research Officer at Al-Khawarizmi Institute of Computer Sciences (KICS), UET, Lahore, Pakistan. Her areas of interest include IoT, IoT security, Machine Learning, Deep Learning, and Next-Generation Firewalls (NGFW).</span></p>', '<p><span style=\"color: #222222; font-family: docs-Calibri; font-size: 15px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Internet of Things, IoT security, Machine Learning, Deep Learning, and Next-Generation Firewalls</span></p>', 1, 0),
