(493, 'Just-in- Time Compilation Inspired Methodology for Parallelization of Compute Intensive Java Code ', 'Mustafa, G., Mahmood, W., Ghani, M. U.', 'Mehran University Research Journal of Engineering &amp; Technology', '36', 0, NULL, 1, 2016, 7, 53, 'Local Conference'),
